      `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts in full within 12 months after the commencement of winding up` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it say the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts in full within 12 months after the commencement of winding up?
      `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due during the 12 months after its date` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it say the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due during the 12 months immediately after the date of the statement?
      `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets is not less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it say the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets is not less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)?
      `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets will not, after the proposal, become less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it say the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets will not, after the proposal, become less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)?
      `the directors intend to commence winding up of the company within the 12 months after the date of the statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the directors intend to commence winding up of the company within the 12 months immediately after the date of the statement?
      `the number of directors of the company` IS A NUMBER @desc How many directors does the company have?
      `the number of directors who signed the statement as a written declaration` IS A NUMBER @desc How many directors signed the statement as a written declaration?
      `the statement is accompanied by a report from the company's auditor that the auditor has inquired into the affairs of the company and is of the opinion that the statement is not unreasonable given all the circumstances` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement accompanied by a report from the company's auditor that the auditor has inquired into the affairs of the company and is of the opinion that the statement is not unreasonable given all the circumstances?
