    `s 10(5) the person is appointed as an auditor of the company by the appointment of the accounting firm` `the accounting firm was appointed as auditor of the company in the name of the firm` `the person was a partner of the firm at the time of the appointment` `the person was a public accountant at that time`

-- s 10(6): the directors and employees of a corporation practising as public accountants in it are appointed by the corporation's appointment in its own name.
@export Under section 10(6), is the person appointed as an auditor of the company by the appointment of the accounting corporation?
GIVEN `the accounting corporation was appointed as auditor of the company in the name of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the accounting corporation appointed as auditor of the company in the name of the corporation?
      `the person is a director of the corporation practising as a public accountant in the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person a director of the corporation practising as a public accountant in the corporation, whether a director when the corporation was appointed or later?
      `the person is an employee of the corporation practising as a public accountant in the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person an employee of the corporation practising as a public accountant in the corporation, whether employed when the corporation was appointed or later?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 10(6), is the person appointed as an auditor of the company by the appointment of the accounting corporation` IS
    `s 10(6) the person is appointed as an auditor of the company by the appointment of the accounting corporation` `the accounting corporation was appointed as auditor of the company in the name of the corporation` `the person is a director of the corporation practising as a public accountant in the corporation` `the person is an employee of the corporation practising as a public accountant in the corporation`

-- ss 10(5) and (6) name a firm and a corporation and not a limited liability partnership: the text is silent, so the answer is always NOTHING.
@export Under section 10(5) and (6), is the person appointed as an auditor of the company by the appointment of the accounting limited liability partnership?
GIVEN `the accounting limited liability partnership was appointed as auditor of the company in its own name` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the accounting limited liability partnership appointed as auditor of the company in its own name?
      `the person is a partner of the limited liability partnership` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person a partner of the limited liability partnership?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 10(5) and (6), is the person appointed as an auditor of the company by the appointment of the accounting limited liability partnership` IS
    `s 10(5) and (6) the person is appointed as an auditor of the company by the appointment of the accounting limited liability partnership` `the accounting limited liability partnership was appointed as auditor of the company in its own name` `the person is a partner of the limited liability partnership`

