      `the person is the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you the company?
      `the person is an officer of the company who is in default` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you an officer of the company who is in default?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 59(2), am I guilty of the offence of default` IS
    `s 59(2) the person is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` `default is made in complying with section 59` `the person is the company` `the person is an officer of the company who is in default`

@export Under section 59(2), what is the highest fine I may be sentenced to, in Singapore dollars?
GIVEN `default is made in complying with section 59` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that default is made in complying with section 59?
      `the person is the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you the company?
      `the person is an officer of the company who is in default` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you an officer of the company who is in default?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 59(2), what is the highest fine I may be sentenced to, in Singapore dollars` IS
    CONSIDER `s 59(2) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` `default is made in complying with section 59` `the person is the company` `the person is an officer of the company who is in default`
