      `the person is the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you the company?
      `the person is an officer of the company who is in default` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you an officer of the company who is in default?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 59(2), what is the longest imprisonment I may be sentenced to, in months` IS
