      `the director did believe, up to the time of the delivery for registration of the statement in lieu of prospectus, that the untrue statement was true or the non-disclosure immaterial` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you, as the director, believe up to the time of the delivery for registration of the statement in lieu of prospectus that the untrue statement was true or the non-disclosure immaterial?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
