GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(8)(g), is the act one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a guarantee or security by a subsidiary of a borrowing corporation` IS
    `s 76(8)(g) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a guarantee or security by a subsidiary of a borrowing corporation` `the corporation is or will be under a liability (whether or not present or future) to repay money` `the money was received, or is to be received, by the corporation in response to an invitation to the public to subscribe for or purchase debentures of the corporation` `the other corporation controls the composition of the board of the firstmentioned corporation` `the other corporation controls more than half of the voting power of the firstmentioned corporation` `the firstmentioned corporation is a subsidiary of a corporation which is the other corporation's subsidiary` `the act is the giving, by the company, of a guarantee in relation to the repayment of those moneys` `the act is the provision, by the company, of security in relation to the repayment of those moneys` `the act was done in good faith` `the act was done in the ordinary course of commercial dealing`

