    `s 76(8)(ga) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a representation, warranty or indemnity on an offer to the public` `the act is the giving by the company of a representation, warranty or indemnity` `the representation, warranty or indemnity is in relation to an offer to the public of, or an invitation to the public to subscribe for or purchase, shares or units of shares in that company` `the act was done in good faith` `the act was done in the ordinary course of commercial dealing`

