      `the other corporation is deemed to be related to the corporation by virtue of section 6` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the other corporation deemed to be related to the corporation by virtue of section 6?
      `the shares or units of shares are to be held by or for the benefit of a director holding a salaried employment or office in the company or in the related corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares or units of shares to be held by or for the benefit of a director holding a salaried employment or office in the company or in the related corporation?
