      `the listed corporation or the ultimate holding company has, by special resolution, approved the giving of the financial assistance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the listed corporation or the ultimate holding company has, by special resolution, approved the giving of the financial assistance?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(10)(b), has the listed corporation or ultimate holding company approved the giving by special resolution` IS
    `s 76(10)(b) the listed corporation or ultimate holding company has approved the giving by special resolution` `paragraph (b) applies to the company` `the listed corporation or the ultimate holding company has, by special resolution, approved the giving of the financial assistance`

@export Under section 76(10)(c), are the notice and the statement as the paragraph requires?
GIVEN `the notice specifying the intention to propose the special resolution sets out particulars of the financial assistance proposed to be given and the reasons for the proposal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the notice specifying the intention to propose the special resolution set out particulars of the financial assistance proposed to be given and the reasons for the proposal?
      `the notice sets out the effect that the giving of the financial assistance would have on the financial position of the company and, where the company is in a group of corporations, of the group` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the notice set out the effect that the giving of the financial assistance would have on the financial position of the company and, where the company is in a group of corporations, of the group?
      `the notice is accompanied by a copy of a statement made in accordance with a resolution of the directors` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the notice accompanied by a copy of a statement made in accordance with a resolution of the directors?
      `the statement sets out the names of any directors who voted against the resolution and the reasons why they so voted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the statement set out the names of any directors who voted against the resolution and the reasons why they so voted?
      `the number of directors who signed the statement` IS A NUMBER @desc How many directors signed the statement?
      `the statement states whether, in the opinion of the directors who voted in favour of the resolution, the giving of the financial assistance would be likely to prejudice materially the interests of the creditors or members of the company or any class of them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the statement state whether, in the opinion of the directors who voted in favour of the resolution, the giving of the financial assistance would be likely to prejudice materially the interests of the creditors or members of the company or any class of them?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(10)(c), are the notice and the statement as the paragraph requires` IS
    `s 76(10)(c) the notice and the statement are as the paragraph requires` `the notice specifying the intention to propose the special resolution sets out particulars of the financial assistance proposed to be given and the reasons for the proposal` `the notice sets out the effect that the giving of the financial assistance would have on the financial position of the company and, where the company is in a group of corporations, of the group` `the notice is accompanied by a copy of a statement made in accordance with a resolution of the directors` `the statement sets out the names of any directors who voted against the resolution and the reasons why they so voted` `the number of directors who signed the statement` `the statement states whether, in the opinion of the directors who voted in favour of the resolution, the giving of the financial assistance would be likely to prejudice materially the interests of the creditors or members of the company or any class of them`

