benture holders whose names were known to the listed corporation or ultimate holding company when the notice was despatched`) (`Under section 76(10), the answer a paragraph gives when the person says whether it is complied with` `the requirement in paragraph (h) of section 76(10) is complied with`) (`Under section 76(10), the answer a paragraph gives when the person says whether it is complied with` `the requirement in paragraph (i) of section 76(10) is complied with`) (`Under section 76(10), the answer a paragraph gives when the person says whether it is complied with` `the requirement in paragraph (j) of section 76(10) is complied with`)

