      `the Court is satisfied that the disposition would in the absence of subsection (1A) be void` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the Court satisfied that the disposition would in the absence of subsection (1A) be void?
      `an application has been made by the Registrar or any other person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has an application been made by the Registrar or any other person?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76A(1A), may the Court order the transfer of the shares acquired in contravention of subsection (1)` IS
    `s 76A(1A) the Court may order the transfer of the shares acquired in contravention of subsection (1)` `the disposition is a disposition of book-entry securities` `the Court is satisfied that the disposition would in the absence of subsection (1A) be void` `an application has been made by the Registrar or any other person`

