      `the date on which the last such proceedings were brought to an end` IS A DATE @desc What is the date on which the last such proceedings were brought to an end?
      `the date the documents in paragraph (e) were lodged with the Registrar` IS A DATE @desc What is the date the documents in paragraph (e) were lodged with the Registrar?
      `the company has lodged with the Registrar a statement made by the directors confirming that the requirements under section 78C(1)(c), the solvency requirements under section 78C(3) (if applicable) and section 78D(4) have been complied with, and that the proceedings in relation to each such application have been brought to an end by the dismissal of the application or without determination` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company lodged with the Registrar a statement made by the directors confirming that the requirements under section 78C(1)(c), the solvency requirements under section 78C(3) (if applicable) and section 78D(4) have been complied with, and that the proceedings in relation to each such application have been brought to an end by the dismissal of the application or without determination?
      `the company has lodged with the Registrar, in relation to each such application which has been dismissed by the Court, a copy of the order of the Court dismissing the application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company lodged with the Registrar, in relation to each such application which has been dismissed by the Court, a copy of the order of the Court dismissing the application?
      `the company has lodged with the Registrar a notice containing the reduction information` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company lodged with the Registrar a notice containing the reduction information?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 78E(4), has the public company satisfied the conditions for the reduction of capital to take effect` IS
    `s 78E(4) the public company has satisfied the conditions for the reduction of capital to take effect` `the company is a public company` `the company passes a special resolution for reducing its share capital` `the company meets the requirements under section 78C(1)(c) and the solvency requirements (if applicable) under section 78C(3)` `one or more applications for cancellation of the resolution have been made under section 78D(2) during the 6 weeks beginning with the resolution date` `the company has complied with section 78D(4)(b) (notification to Registrar) in relation to all such applications` `the proceedings in relation to each such application have been brought to an end by the dismissal of the application under section 78F or without determination` `the date on which the last such proceedings were brought to an end` `the date the documents in paragraph (e) were lodged with the Registrar` `the company has lodged with the Registrar a statement made by the directors confirming that the requirements under section 78C(1)(c), the solvency requirements under section 78C(3) (if applicable) and section 78D(4) have been complied with, and that the proceedings in relation to each such application have been brought to an end by the dismissal of the application or without determination` `the company has lodged with the Registrar, in relation to each such application which has been dismissed by the Court, a copy of the order of the Court dismissing the application` `the company has lodged with the Registrar a notice containing the reduction information`

@export Under section 78E(5), do the resolution and the reduction of the share capital take effect?
GIVEN `the case is one referred to in subsection (1), (2), (3) or (4) and the lodgement it requires has been made` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the case one referred to in subsection (1), (2), (3) or (4) and the lodgement it requires has been made?
      `the Registrar has recorded the information lodged with him or her in the appropriate register` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Registrar recorded the information lodged with him or her in the appropriate register?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 78E(5), do the resolution and the reduction of the share capital take effect` IS
    `s 78E(5) the resolution and the reduction of the share capital take effect` `the case is one referred to in subsection (1), (2), (3) or (4) and the lodgement it requires has been made` `the Registrar has recorded the information lodged with him or her in the appropriate register`

