      `the officer intentionally conceals the name of a qualifying creditor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the officer intentionally conceal the name of a qualifying creditor?
      `the officer intentionally misrepresents the nature or amount of the debt or claim of any creditor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the officer intentionally misrepresent the nature or amount of the debt or claim of any creditor?
      `the officer aids, abets or is privy to any such concealment or misrepresentation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the officer aid or abet any such concealment or misrepresentation, or is the officer privy to it?
