      `the Court is satisfied that the qualifying creditor has consented to the reduction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the Court satisfied that the qualifying creditor has consented to the reduction?
      `the Court is satisfied that the qualifying creditor's debt or claim has been secured or the qualifying creditor has other adequate safeguards for it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the Court satisfied that the qualifying creditor's debt or claim has been secured or the qualifying creditor has other adequate safeguards for it?
      `the Court is satisfied that security or other safeguards are unnecessary in view of the assets the company would have after the reduction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the Court satisfied that security or other safeguards are unnecessary in view of the assets the company would have after the reduction?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 78I(2), is the Court barred from making an order approving the reduction` IS
    `s 78I(2) the Court must not make an order approving the reduction` (LIST (`s 78I(2) qualifying creditor` OF `the creditor is included in the Court's list of qualifying creditors under section 78H`, `the creditor's claim has not been terminated or the creditor's debt has not been discharged`, `the Court is satisfied that the qualifying creditor has consented to the reduction`, `the Court is satisfied that the qualifying creditor's debt or claim has been secured or the qualifying creditor has other adequate safeguards for it`, `the Court is satisfied that security or other safeguards are unnecessary in view of the assets the company would have after the reduction`))

