      `the age of the person, in years` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the age of the person, in years?
      `the person is otherwise of full legal capacity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person is otherwise of full legal capacity?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 145(2), is a person barred from being a director of a company` IS
    `s 145(2) the subsection bars the person from being a director of a company` `the person is a natural person` `the age of the person, in years` `the person is otherwise of full legal capacity`

@export Under section 145(4), is a constitution provision in force before 29 December 1967 that made a corporation a director read as authorising the corporation to appoint a natural person to be a director?
GIVEN `the provision of the constitution was in force immediately before 29 December 1967` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the provision of the constitution was in force immediately before 29 December 1967?
      `the provision operated to constitute a corporation as a director of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the provision operated to constitute a corporation as a director of the company?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 145(4), is a constitution provision in force before 29 December 1967 that made a corporation a director read as authorising the corporation to appoint a natural person to be a director` IS
    `s 145(4) the provision is read as authorising the corporation to appoint a natural person to be a director` `the provision of the constitution was in force immediately before 29 December 1967` `the provision operated to constitute a corporation as a director of the company`

@export Under section 145(4A), may a director resign by giving the company a written notice of resignation?
GIVEN `the constitution otherwise provides` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the constitution otherwise provides?
      `the director gives the company a written notice of his or her resignation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the director gives the company a written notice of his or her resignation?
      `at least one director who is ordinarily resident in Singapore would remain in the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that at least one director who is ordinarily resident in Singapore would remain in the company?
      `the director is required to resign or vacate office because the director has not within the period referred to in section 147(1) obtained his or her qualification` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the director is required to resign or vacate office because the director has not within the period referred to in section 147(1) obtained his or her qualification?
      `the ground on which the director is required to resign or vacate office by virtue of disqualification, removal or revocation` IS A `s 145(6)(b) ground on which the director is required to resign or vacate office` @desc Which applies: the ground on which the director is required to resign or vacate office by virtue of disqualification, removal or revocation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 145(4A), may a director resign by giving the company a written notice of resignation` IS
    `s 145(4A) the director may resign by giving the company a written notice of resignation` `the constitution otherwise provides` `the director gives the company a written notice of his or her resignation` `at least one director who is ordinarily resident in Singapore would remain in the company` `the director is required to resign or vacate office because the director has not within the period referred to in section 147(1) obtained his or her qualification` `the ground on which the director is required to resign or vacate office by virtue of disqualification, removal or revocation`

@export Under section 145(4B), is a director's resignation conditional upon the company's acceptance of it?
GIVEN `at least one director who is ordinarily resident in Singapore would remain in the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that at least one director who is ordinarily resident in Singapore would remain in the company?
      `the director is required to resign or vacate office because the director has not within the period referred to in section 147(1) obtained his or her qualification` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the director is required to resign or vacate office because the director has not within the period referred to in section 147(1) obtained his or her qualification?
      `the ground on which the director is required to resign or vacate office by virtue of disqualification, removal or revocation` IS A `s 145(6)(b) ground on which the director is required to resign or vacate office` @desc Which applies: the ground on which the director is required to resign or vacate office by virtue of disqualification, removal or revocation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 145(4B), is a director's resignation conditional upon the company's acceptance of it` IS
    `s 145(4B) the resignation is conditional upon the company's acceptance of it` `at least one director who is ordinarily resident in Singapore would remain in the company` `the director is required to resign or vacate office because the director has not within the period referred to in section 147(1) obtained his or her qualification` `the ground on which the director is required to resign or vacate office by virtue of disqualification, removal or revocation`

@export Under section 145(5), is a director barred from resigning or vacating office?
GIVEN `at least one director who is ordinarily resident in Singapore would remain in the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that at least one director who is ordinarily resident in Singapore would remain in the company?
      `the director is required to resign or vacate office because the director has not within the period referred to in section 147(1) obtained his or her qualification` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the director is required to resign or vacate office because the director has not within the period referred to in section 147(1) obtained his or her qualification?
      `the ground on which the director is required to resign or vacate office by virtue of disqualification, removal or revocation` IS A `s 145(6)(b) ground on which the director is required to resign or vacate office` @desc Which applies: the ground on which the director is required to resign or vacate office by virtue of disqualification, removal or revocation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 145(5), is a director barred from resigning or vacating office` IS
    `s 145(5) the subsection bars the director from resigning or vacating office` `at least one director who is ordinarily resident in Singapore would remain in the company` `the director is required to resign or vacate office because the director has not within the period referred to in section 147(1) obtained his or her qualification` `the ground on which the director is required to resign or vacate office by virtue of disqualification, removal or revocation`

