      `the person is a director of that company immediately before the order was made` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person is a director of that company immediately before the order was made?
      `the person is a secretary of that company immediately before the order was made` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person is a secretary of that company immediately before the order was made?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 155B(2), is a person with a debarment order barred from acting as director or secretary of a company` IS
    `s 155B(2) the subsection bars the person from acting as director or secretary of the company` `the person has a debarment order made against him or her` `the debarment order is in force` `what the person acts as in the company (debarment order under section 155B)` `the person is a director of that company immediately before the order was made` `the person is a secretary of that company immediately before the order was made`

