GIVEN `the person has a debarment order made against him or her under section 59 of the VCC Act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person has a debarment order made against him or her under section 59 of the VCC Act?
      `subsection (1) applies on the date asked` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that subsection (1) applies on the date asked?
      `what the person acts as in the company (debarment order under the VCC Act, section 155E)` IS A `s 155E(1) what the person acts as` @desc Which applies: what the person acts as in the company (debarment order under the VCC Act, section 155E)?
      `the person is a director of that company immediately before the order was made` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person is a director of that company immediately before the order was made?
      `the person is a secretary of that company immediately before the order was made` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person is a secretary of that company immediately before the order was made?
