    `s 155E(1) the subsection bars the person from acting as director or secretary of the company` `the person has a debarment order made against him or her under section 59 of the VCC Act` `subsection (1) applies on the date asked` `what the person acts as in the company (debarment order under the VCC Act, section 155E)` `the person is a director of that company immediately before the order was made` `the person is a secretary of that company immediately before the order was made`

