      `the Registrar has cancelled the debarment order` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the Registrar has cancelled the debarment order?
      `the Registrar has suspended the debarment order` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the Registrar has suspended the debarment order?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
