§ `Section 156: disclosure of interests in transactions, property, offices and so on`

@export Under section 156(1), must a director or chief executive officer declare the nature of an interest in a transaction or send a written notice?
GIVEN `the person is a director or chief executive officer of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person is a director or chief executive officer of the company?
      `the person is in any way, whether directly or indirectly, interested in a transaction or proposed transaction with the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person is in any way, whether directly or indirectly, interested in a transaction or proposed transaction with the company?
      `the person is not deemed to be interested by reason of subsection (4)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person is not deemed to be interested by reason of subsection (4)?
      `the interest of the director or chief executive officer consists only of being a member or creditor of a corporation which is interested in the transaction or proposed transaction with the firstmentioned company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the interest of the director or chief executive officer consists only of being a member or creditor of a corporation which is interested in the transaction or proposed transaction with the firstmentioned company?
      `the interest may properly be regarded as not being a material interest` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the interest may properly be regarded as not being a material interest?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 156(1), must a director or chief executive officer declare the nature of an interest in a transaction or send a written notice` IS
    `s 156(1) the director or chief executive officer must declare the nature of the interest or send a written notice` `the person is a director or chief executive officer of the company` `the person is in any way, whether directly or indirectly, interested in a transaction or proposed transaction with the company` `the person is not deemed to be interested by reason of subsection (4)` `the interest of the director or chief executive officer consists only of being a member or creditor of a corporation which is interested in the transaction or proposed transaction with the firstmentioned company` `the interest may properly be regarded as not being a material interest`

@export Under section 156(1), has a person made the declaration or sent the written notice the subsection requires?
GIVEN `the person declares the nature of his or her interest at a meeting of the directors of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person declares the nature of his or her interest at a meeting of the directors of the company?
      `the person sends a written notice to the company containing details on the nature, character and extent of his or her interest in the transaction or proposed transaction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person sends a written notice to the company containing details on the nature, character and extent of his or her interest in the transaction or proposed transaction?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 156(1), has a person made the declaration or sent the written notice the subsection requires` IS
    `s 156(1) the person has made the declaration or sent the written notice the subsection requires` `the person declares the nature of his or her interest at a meeting of the directors of the company` `the person sends a written notice to the company containing details on the nature, character and extent of his or her interest in the transaction or proposed transaction`

@export Under section 156(2), from what date must the written notice be given as soon as practicable?
GIVEN `the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she became interested in the transaction or proposed transaction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she became interested in the transaction or proposed transaction?
      `the date on which the person became a director or chief executive officer` IS A DATE @desc What is the date on which the person became a director or chief executive officer?
      `the date on which the person became, directly or indirectly, interested in the transaction or proposed transaction` IS A DATE @desc What is the date on which the person became, directly or indirectly, interested in the transaction or proposed transaction?
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `Under section 156(2), from what date must the written notice be given as soon as practicable` IS
    `s 156(2) the date after which the notice under subsection (1)(b) must be given as soon as practicable` `the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she became interested in the transaction or proposed transaction` `the date on which the person became a director or chief executive officer` `the date on which the person became, directly or indirectly, interested in the transaction or proposed transaction`

@export Under section 156(3), do the requirements of section 156(1) not apply to an interest that consists only of being a member or creditor of a corporation?
GIVEN `the interest of the director or chief executive officer consists only of being a member or creditor of a corporation which is interested in the transaction or proposed transaction with the firstmentioned company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the interest of the director or chief executive officer consists only of being a member or creditor of a corporation which is interested in the transaction or proposed transaction with the firstmentioned company?
      `the interest may properly be regarded as not being a material interest` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the interest may properly be regarded as not being a material interest?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 156(3), do the requirements of section 156(1) not apply to an interest that consists only of being a member or creditor of a corporation` IS
    `s 156(3) the requirements of subsection (1) do not apply` `the interest of the director or chief executive officer consists only of being a member or creditor of a corporation which is interested in the transaction or proposed transaction with the firstmentioned company` `the interest may properly be regarded as not being a material interest`

@export Under section 156(4), is a director or chief executive officer not deemed to be interested in a transaction by reason only of a guarantee of a loan or of an office in a related corporation?
GIVEN `the transaction or proposed transaction relates to a loan to the company and the director or chief executive officer has guaranteed or joined in guaranteeing the repayment of the loan or any part of the loan` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the transaction or proposed transaction relates to a loan to the company and the director or chief executive officer has guaranteed or joined in guaranteeing the repayment of the loan or any part of the loan?
      `the transaction or proposed transaction has been or will be made with or for the benefit of or on behalf of a corporation which by virtue of section 6 is deemed to be related to the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the transaction or proposed transaction has been or will be made with or for the benefit of or on behalf of a corporation which by virtue of section 6 is deemed to be related to the company?
      `the director or chief executive officer is a director or chief executive officer of that corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the director or chief executive officer is a director or chief executive officer of that corporation?
      `that is the only reason the director or chief executive officer would be treated as interested in the transaction or proposed transaction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that that is the only reason the director or chief executive officer would be treated as interested in the transaction or proposed transaction?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 156(4), is a director or chief executive officer not deemed to be interested in a transaction by reason only of a guarantee of a loan or of an office in a related corporation` IS
    `s 156(4) the director or chief executive officer is not deemed to be interested in the transaction by reason only of the guarantee or the office` `the transaction or proposed transaction relates to a loan to the company and the director or chief executive officer has guaranteed or joined in guaranteeing the repayment of the loan or any part of the loan` `the transaction or proposed transaction has been or will be made with or for the benefit of or on behalf of a corporation which by virtue of section 6 is deemed to be related to the company` `the director or chief executive officer is a director or chief executive officer of that corporation` `that is the only reason the director or chief executive officer would be treated as interested in the transaction or proposed transaction`

@export Under section 156(4), does the subsection have effect for a given purpose?
GIVEN `the purpose` IS A `s 156(4) purpose` @desc Which applies: the purpose?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 156(4), does the subsection have effect for a given purpose` IS
    `s 156(4) the subsection has effect for the purpose` `the purpose`

@export Under section 156(5), is a general declaration or written notice treated as a sufficient declaration or written notice for a later transaction?
GIVEN `the kind of paper` IS A `s 156(5) kind of paper` @desc Which applies: the kind of paper?
      `the declaration is given at a meeting of the directors` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the declaration is given at a meeting of the directors?
      `the person takes reasonable steps to ensure that the declaration is brought up and read at the next meeting of the directors after it is given` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person takes reasonable steps to ensure that the declaration is brought up and read at the next meeting of the directors after it is given?
      `the declaration or written notice is to the effect that the person is an officer or a member of a specified corporation, a member of a specified firm, or a partner or officer of a specified limited liability partnership` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the declaration or written notice is to the effect that the person is an officer or a member of a specified corporation, a member of a specified firm, or a partner or officer of a specified limited liability partnership?
      `the declaration or written notice is to the effect that the person is to be regarded as interested in any transaction which may, after its date, be made with the specified corporation, firm or limited liability partnership` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the declaration or written notice is to the effect that the person is to be regarded as interested in any transaction which may, after its date, be made with the specified corporation, firm or limited liability partnership?
      `the declaration or written notice specifies the nature and extent of the person's interest in the specified corporation, firm or limited liability partnership` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the declaration or written notice specifies the nature and extent of the person's interest in the specified corporation, firm or limited liability partnership?
      `at the time the transaction is made, or the proposed transaction is proposed, the person's interest is not different in nature or greater in extent than the nature and extent specified` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that at the time the transaction is made, or the proposed transaction is proposed, the person's interest is not different in nature or greater in extent than the nature and extent specified?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 156(5), is a general declaration or written notice treated as a sufficient declaration or written notice for a later transaction` IS
    `s 156(5) the declaration or written notice is treated as a sufficient declaration or written notice in relation to the transaction` `the kind of paper` `the declaration is given at a meeting of the directors` `the person takes reasonable steps to ensure that the declaration is brought up and read at the next meeting of the directors after it is given` `the declaration or written notice is to the effect that the person is an officer or a member of a specified corporation, a member of a specified firm, or a partner or officer of a specified limited liability partnership` `the declaration or written notice is to the effect that the person is to be regarded as interested in any transaction which may, after its date, be made with the specified corporation, firm or limited liability partnership` `the declaration or written notice specifies the nature and extent of the person's interest in the specified corporation, firm or limited liability partnership` `at the time the transaction is made, or the proposed transaction is proposed, the person's interest is not different in nature or greater in extent than the nature and extent specified`

@export Under section 156(6), must a director or chief executive officer declare a conflict of duty or interest or send a written notice?
GIVEN `the person is a director or chief executive officer of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person is a director or chief executive officer of the company?
      `the person holds any office or possesses any property whereby, whether directly or indirectly, any duty or interest might be created in conflict with the person's duties or interests as director or chief executive officer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person holds any office or possesses any property whereby, whether directly or indirectly, any duty or interest might be created in conflict with the person's duties or interests as director or chief executive officer?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 156(6), must a director or chief executive officer declare a conflict of duty or interest or send a written notice` IS
    `s 156(6) the director or chief executive officer must declare the conflict or send a written notice` `the person is a director or chief executive officer of the company` `the person holds any office or possesses any property whereby, whether directly or indirectly, any duty or interest might be created in conflict with the person's duties or interests as director or chief executive officer`

@export Under section 156(6), has a person made the declaration or sent the written notice the subsection requires?
GIVEN `the person declares at a meeting of the directors of the company the fact and the nature, character and extent of the conflict` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person declares at a meeting of the directors of the company the fact and the nature, character and extent of the conflict?
      `the person sends a written notice to the company setting out the fact and the nature, character and extent of the conflict` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person sends a written notice to the company setting out the fact and the nature, character and extent of the conflict?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 156(6), has a person made the declaration or sent the written notice the subsection requires` IS
    `s 156(6) the person has made the declaration or sent the written notice the subsection requires` `the person declares at a meeting of the directors of the company the fact and the nature, character and extent of the conflict` `the person sends a written notice to the company setting out the fact and the nature, character and extent of the conflict`

-- s 156(7). A declaration under subsection (6)(a) must be made at the first meeting of the directors held after the person becomes a director or chief executive
-- officer or, if already one, after the person commenced to hold the office or to possess the property. The layer-1 function takes the dates of the meetings as a LIST;
-- this question asks for the dates of the next three meetings, one by one, and builds the list inside (a person cannot state a list).
@export Under section 156(7), at which meeting of the directors must a person declare a conflict of duty or interest?
GIVEN `the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she commenced to hold the office or to possess the property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she commenced to hold the office or to possess the property?
      `the date the person became a director or chief executive officer` IS A DATE @desc What is the date the person became a director or chief executive officer?
      `the date the person commenced to hold the office or to possess the property` IS A DATE @desc What is the date the person commenced to hold the office or to possess the property?
      `the date of the next meeting of the directors` IS A DATE @desc What is the date of the next meeting of the directors?
      `the date of the meeting of the directors after that` IS A DATE @desc What is the date of the meeting of the directors after that?
      `the date of the meeting of the directors after that one` IS A DATE @desc What is the date of the meeting of the directors after that one?
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `Under section 156(7), at which meeting of the directors must a person declare a conflict of duty or interest` IS
    `s 156(7) the meeting of the directors at which the declaration under subsection (6)(a) must be made` `the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she commenced to hold the office or to possess the property` `the date the person became a director or chief executive officer` `the date the person commenced to hold the office or to possess the property` `the dates of the meetings of the directors`
    WHERE
        `the dates of the meetings of the directors` MEANS LIST `the date of the next meeting of the directors`, `the date of the meeting of the directors after that`, `the date of the meeting of the directors after that one`

@export Under section 156(8), from what date must the written notice of a conflict be given as soon as practicable?
GIVEN `the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she commenced to hold the office or to possess the property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she commenced to hold the office or to possess the property?
      `the date on which the person became a director or chief executive officer` IS A DATE @desc What is the date on which the person became a director or chief executive officer?
      `the date on which the person commenced to hold the office or to possess the property` IS A DATE @desc What is the date on which the person commenced to hold the office or to possess the property?
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `Under section 156(8), from what date must the written notice of a conflict be given as soon as practicable` IS
    `s 156(8) the date after which the written notice under subsection (6)(b) must be given as soon as practicable` `the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she commenced to hold the office or to possess the property` `the date on which the person became a director or chief executive officer` `the date on which the person commenced to hold the office or to possess the property`

@export Under section 156(9), to whom must the company send a copy of the written notice?
GIVEN `the company has received the written notice mentioned in subsection (1)(b) or (6)(b)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the company has received the written notice mentioned in subsection (1)(b) or (6)(b)?
      `the notice is given by a chief executive officer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the notice is given by a chief executive officer?
      `the notice is given by a director` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the notice is given by a director?
GIVETH A `s 156(9) to whom the company must send a copy`
DECIDE `Under section 156(9), to whom must the company send a copy of the written notice` IS
    `s 156(9) the persons to whom the company must send a copy of the notice` `the company has received the written notice mentioned in subsection (1)(b) or (6)(b)` `the notice is given by a chief executive officer` `the notice is given by a director`

@export Under section 156(10)(a), is the making of a declaration by written notice deemed to form part of the proceedings at the next meeting of the directors?
GIVEN `the director or chief executive officer declares an interest or conflict by a written notice mentioned in subsection (1)(b) or (6)(b) in accordance with section 156` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the director or chief executive officer declares an interest or conflict by a written notice mentioned in subsection (1)(b) or (6)(b) in accordance with section 156?
