DECIDE `Under section 173A(1)(d), did the company furnish the information about the person's ceasing to be qualified in time` IS
    `s 173A(1)(d) the company furnished the information about the person's ceasing to be qualified in time` `the day the company became aware that the person has ceased to be qualified to act as a director of the company by virtue of a provision or order the paragraph names` `the day the company furnished the notice` `the notice gives the fact that the person has ceased to be qualified to act as a director of the company` `the notice gives the provision of this Act under which the person ceased to be qualified or the disqualification order was made` `the notice gives the date on which the person ceased to be qualified to act as a director of the company`

