    `s 173E(1)(a) the director notified the company of the disqualification in time` `the day the director ceased to be qualified to act as a director by virtue of a provision or order the subsection names` `the day the section 66 of the Corporate and Accounting Laws (Amendment) Act 2025 commenced` `the day the director notified the company of the disqualification` `the director notified the company as soon as practicable`

