DECIDE `Under section 173G(3), must the Registrar exclude the individual's residential address from public access` IS
    `s 173G(3) the Registrar must exclude the individual's residential address from public access` `before the commencement date the residential address of the individual has been entered in the register of directors, chief executive officers or secretaries of the company` `on the commencement date those registers do not show that the individual holds any of those positions in the same company`

