      `the company has obtained the approval of the Registrar to the non-compliance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the company has obtained the approval of the Registrar to the non-compliance?
      `financial statements prepared in accordance with a requirement of the Accounting Standards would not give a true and fair view of a matter required by section 201 to be dealt with in them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that financial statements prepared in accordance with a requirement of the Accounting Standards would not give a true and fair view of a matter required by section 201 to be dealt with in them?
