      `the directors have taken reasonable steps to cause all known bad debts to be written off and adequate provision to be made for doubtful debts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the directors have taken reasonable steps to cause all known bad debts to be written off and adequate provision to be made for doubtful debts?
