-- calls 's 202B(2)(b) the directors must inform the Registrar how they propose to revise the financial statements' (sgc1-s202.l4)
@export Under section 202B(2)(b), must the directors inform the Registrar how they propose to revise the financial statements?
GIVEN `the Registrar has given the directors notice under section 202B(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the Registrar has given the directors notice under section 202B(1)?
      `the directors propose to revise the financial statements` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the directors propose to revise the financial statements?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 202B(2)(b), must the directors inform the Registrar how they propose to revise the financial statements` IS
