    `s 202B(4) the directors may cause the financial statements to be revised in the manner agreed` `the Registrar agrees with the directors on the manner in which to revise the statements referred to in subsection (2)(b)`

-- calls 's 202B(5) the Registrar may apply to Court under subsection (6)' (sgc1-s202.l4)
@export Under section 202B(5), may the Registrar apply to Court under subsection (6)?
GIVEN `the Registrar does not receive a response from the directors after giving the notice mentioned in subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the Registrar does not receive a response from the directors after giving the notice mentioned in subsection (1)?
      `the Registrar is not satisfied with the explanation mentioned in subsection (2)(a)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the Registrar is not satisfied with the explanation mentioned in subsection (2)(a)?
      `the Registrar does not agree with the directors on the manner of revision referred to in subsection (2)(b)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the Registrar does not agree with the directors on the manner of revision referred to in subsection (2)(b)?
