    `s 202B(7) the Court may give directions on the matter` `the Court has ordered the preparation of revised financial statements, or consolidated financial statements or balance sheet, under subsection (6)` `the matter of directions in question`

-- calls 's 202B(8) the Court may order that the director bears all or part of the costs and expenses' (sgc1-s202.l4)
@export Under section 202B(8), may the Court order that I, as a director, bear all or part of the costs and expenses?
GIVEN `the Court finds that the financial statements, or consolidated financial statements or balance sheet, did not comply with the requirements of this Act (including the Accounting Standards)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the Court finds that the financial statements, or consolidated financial statements or balance sheet, did not comply with the requirements of this Act (including the Accounting Standards)?
      `the person was a director of the company as at the date of the directors' statement which accompanied the defective statements` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person was a director of the company as at the date of the directors' statement which accompanied the defective statements?
