DECIDE `Under section 204(1), am I guilty of the offence of failing to comply with section 201(2) or (5)` IS
    `s 204(1) the person is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` `the person is a director of the company` `the director fails to comply with section 201(2) or (5)`

