      `the item the auditor asks to see` IS A `s 207(5) access item` @desc What does the auditor ask to see: an accounting or other record that is not a register, a register other than one kept under Part 11A, or a register kept under Part 11A?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 207(5), does the auditor have a right of access at all times to the item` IS
    `s 207(5) the auditor has a right of access at all times to the item` `the person is an auditor of the company` `the item the auditor asks to see`

-- The auditor may require from any officer of the company, and any auditor of a company deemed related to it by section 6, the information and explanations the auditor desires for the audit. NOTHING: the text does not say.
