§§ `Section 215: the compulsory acquisition of the shares of dissenting shareholders`

-- s 215(1). The 90% approval, within 4 months after the offer, of a scheme or contract for all of the shares (or all of a class). The 90% is counted against the shares in issue, less treasury shares and the shares
-- subsection (1C) says to disregard, less (for the class limb) the shares the transferee already held.
@export Under section 215(1), has the scheme or contract been approved by the holders of at least 90% of the shares within 4 months of the offer?
GIVEN `what the scheme or contract involves` IS A `s 215(1) what the scheme or contract involves` @desc What does the scheme or contract involve: the transfer of all of the shares in the company, the transfer of all of the shares in a particular class, or the transfer of only some of the shares?
      `the number of the shares in the company, or in the class, in issue, treasury shares included` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares of the company (or of the class concerned) are in issue, treasury shares included?
      `the number of those shares held as treasury shares` IS A NUMBER @desc Of those, how many are held as treasury shares?
      `the number of those shares issued after the date of the offer, other than on the exercise of an option or right attached to a convertible security issued on or before the date of the offer` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of those shares were issued after the date of the offer, other than on the exercise of an option or right attached to a convertible security that the transferor company issued on or before the date of the offer?
      `the number of relevant treasury shares that have ceased to be held as treasury shares after the date of the offer` IS A NUMBER @desc How many relevant treasury shares have ceased to be held as treasury shares after the date of the offer?
      `the number of those shares the transferee already held at the date of the offer` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of those shares did the transferee already hold at the date of the offer?
      `the number of the shares counted whose holders have approved the offer` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of the shares counted are held by holders who have approved the offer?
      `the day the offer was made by the transferee` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the transferee make the offer?
      `the day the holders of the requisite number of the shares approved the offer` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the offer approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(1), has the scheme or contract been approved by the holders of at least 90% of the shares within 4 months of the offer` IS
    `s 215(1) the scheme or contract has been approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares` `what the scheme or contract involves` `the share count` `the day the offer was made by the transferee` `the day the holders of the requisite number of the shares approved the offer`
    WHERE
         `the share count` MEANS `s 215(1) share count` WITH
             `s 215(1) the number of the shares in the company, or in the class, in issue, treasury shares included` IS `the number of the shares in the company, or in the class, in issue, treasury shares included`
             `s 215(1) the number of those shares held as treasury shares` IS `the number of those shares held as treasury shares`
             `s 215(1C)(a) the number of those shares issued after the date of the offer, other than pursuant to the exercise of an option or right attached to a convertible security issued on or before the date of the offer by the transferor company` IS `the number of those shares issued after the date of the offer, other than on the exercise of an option or right attached to a convertible security issued on or before the date of the offer`
             `s 215(1C)(b) the number of relevant treasury shares that have ceased to be held as treasury shares after the date of the offer` IS `the number of relevant treasury shares that have ceased to be held as treasury shares after the date of the offer`
             `s 215(1) the number of those shares already held at the date of the offer by the transferee` IS `the number of those shares the transferee already held at the date of the offer`
             `s 215(1) the number of the shares counted whose holders have approved the offer` IS `the number of the shares counted whose holders have approved the offer`

-- s 215(1). Within 2 months after the offer is so approved, the transferee may give notice in the prescribed manner to any dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shareholder's shares.
@export Under section 215(1), may the transferee give me notice that it desires to acquire my shares?
GIVEN `the scheme or contract has been approved as subsection (1) requires` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the scheme or contract been approved as section 215(1) requires (by the holders of not less than 90% of the shares, within 4 months after the offer)?
      `the day the holders of the requisite number of the shares approved the offer` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the offer approved by the holders of the requisite number of the shares?
      `the day the transferee gave the notice under subsection (1)` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the transferee give the notice that it desires to acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares?
      `I am a dissenting shareholder` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a dissenting shareholder (one who has not assented to the scheme or contract, or has failed or refused to transfer your shares under it)?
      `the notice is given in the prescribed manner` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice given in the prescribed manner?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(1), may the transferee give me notice that it desires to acquire my shares` IS
    `s 215(1) the transferee may give notice to the dissenting shareholder that it desires to acquire the shares` `the scheme or contract has been approved as subsection (1) requires` `the day the holders of the requisite number of the shares approved the offer` `the day the transferee gave the notice under subsection (1)` `I am a dissenting shareholder` `the notice is given in the prescribed manner`

-- s 215(1). The dissenting shareholder may apply to the Court within one month from the notice, or within 14 days of a statement being supplied, whichever is later.
@export Under section 215(1), what is the last day on which I may apply to the Court?
GIVEN `the day the transferee gave the notice under subsection (1)` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the transferee give the notice that it desires to acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares?
      `I was supplied with the statement under subsection (2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you supplied with the written statement of the names and addresses of the other dissenting shareholders?
      `the day the statement was supplied to me` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the statement supplied to you? (any date if it was not)
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `Under section 215(1), what is the last day on which I may apply to the Court` IS
    `s 215(1) the last day of the later of the one month and the 14 days` `the day the transferee gave the notice under subsection (1)` `the day the statement was supplied to me, if there was one`
    WHERE
        `the day the statement was supplied to me, if there was one` MEANS IF `I was supplied with the statement under subsection (2)` THEN JUST `the day the statement was supplied to me` ELSE NOTHING

@export Under section 215(1), is my application to the Court within the time the subsection allows?
GIVEN `the day the transferee gave the notice under subsection (1)` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the transferee give the notice that it desires to acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares?
      `I was supplied with the statement under subsection (2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you supplied with the written statement of the names and addresses of the other dissenting shareholders?
      `the day the statement was supplied to me` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the statement supplied to you? (any date if it was not)
      `the day I applied to the Court` IS A DATE @desc On what day did you apply to the Court?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(1), is my application to the Court within the time the subsection allows` IS
    `s 215(1) the dissenting shareholder's application to the Court is within the time subsection (1) allows` `the day the transferee gave the notice under subsection (1)` `the day the statement was supplied to me, if there was one` `the day I applied to the Court`
    WHERE
        `the day the statement was supplied to me, if there was one` MEANS IF `I was supplied with the statement under subsection (2)` THEN JUST `the day the statement was supplied to me` ELSE NOTHING

-- s 215(1). Unless, on a timely application by the dissenting shareholder, the Court thinks fit to order otherwise, the transferee is entitled and bound to acquire the shares.
@export Under section 215(1), may the Court order that the transferee is not entitled and bound to acquire my shares?
GIVEN `I have applied to the Court` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you applied to the Court?
      `my application is within the time subsection (1) allows` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your application within the time allowed by section 215(1) (one month from the notice, or 14 days from the statement, whichever is later)?
      `the Court thinks fit to order otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the Court think fit to order otherwise?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(1), may the Court order that the transferee is not entitled and bound to acquire my shares` IS
    `s 215(1) the Court may order that the transferee is not entitled and bound to acquire the shares` `I have applied to the Court` `my application is within the time subsection (1) allows` `the Court thinks fit to order otherwise`

@export Under section 215(1), is the transferee entitled and bound to acquire my shares?
GIVEN `the transferee has given the notice under subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the transferee given the notice under section 215(1)?
      `I applied to the Court within the time subsection (1) allows` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you apply to the Court within the time section 215(1) allows?
      `the Court thinks fit to order otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the Court think fit to order otherwise?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(1), is the transferee entitled and bound to acquire my shares` IS
    `s 215(1) the transferee is entitled and bound to acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares` `the transferee has given the notice under subsection (1)` `I applied to the Court within the time subsection (1) allows` `the Court thinks fit to order otherwise`

@export Under section 215(1), on what terms must the transferee acquire my shares?
GIVEN `the offer contained 2 or more alternative sets of terms` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the offer contain two or more alternative sets of terms?
      `I elected in time` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you elect between the terms in time?
GIVETH A `s 215(1) terms`
DECIDE `Under section 215(1), on what terms must the transferee acquire my shares` IS
    `s 215(1) the terms on which the transferee must acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares` `the offer contained 2 or more alternative sets of terms` `I elected in time`

-- s 215(1A). Where alternative terms were offered, the dissenting shareholder is entitled to elect, by the end of the later of one month from the notice and 14 days from the statement.
@export Under section 215(1A), am I entitled to elect which of the terms I prefer?
GIVEN `the offer contained 2 or more alternative sets of terms` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the offer contain two or more alternative sets of terms?
      `the day the transferee gave the notice under subsection (1)` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the transferee give the notice that it desires to acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares?
      `I was supplied with the statement under subsection (2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you supplied with the written statement of the names and addresses of the other dissenting shareholders?
      `the day the statement was supplied to me` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the statement supplied to you? (any date if it was not)
      `the day I elected` IS A DATE @desc On what day did you elect between the terms?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(1A), am I entitled to elect which of the terms I prefer` IS
    `s 215(1A) the dissenting shareholder is entitled to elect which of the terms the shareholder prefers` `the offer contained 2 or more alternative sets of terms` `the day the transferee gave the notice under subsection (1)` `the day the statement was supplied to me, if there was one` `the day I elected`
    WHERE
        `the day the statement was supplied to me, if there was one` MEANS IF `I was supplied with the statement under subsection (2)` THEN JUST `the day the statement was supplied to me` ELSE NOTHING

-- s 215(1B). In offering alternative terms, the transferee must state which are to apply if a dissenting shareholder fails to elect in time.
@export Under section 215(1B), has the transferee stated which of the terms is to apply if I fail to elect in time?
GIVEN `the offer contained 2 or more alternative sets of terms` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the offer contain two or more alternative sets of terms?
      `the offer states which of those terms is to apply on a failure to elect` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the offer state which of the alternative terms is to apply where a dissenting shareholder fails to elect in time?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(1B), has the transferee stated which of the terms is to apply if I fail to elect in time` IS
    `s 215(1B) the transferee has stated which of the terms is to apply on a failure to elect` `the offer contained 2 or more alternative sets of terms` `the offer states which of those terms is to apply on a failure to elect`

-- s 215(1C) to (1E). Shares issued after the offer are disregarded unless issued on the exercise of an option or right attached to a convertible security issued on or before the offer; relevant treasury
-- shares that cease to be so held are disregarded; a later issue on such an exercise does not affect the approval, the right to give notice or the notice's validity.
@export Under section 215(1C)(a), are the shares to be disregarded in counting the 90%?
GIVEN `the shares were issued after the date of the offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the shares issued after the date of the offer?
      `the shares were issued on the exercise of an option or right attached to a convertible security issued before the offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the shares issued on the exercise of an option or right attached to a convertible security that the transferor company issued on or before the date of the offer?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(1C)(a), are the shares to be disregarded in counting the 90%` IS
    `s 215(1C)(a) the shares are to be disregarded` `the shares were issued after the date of the offer` `the shares were issued on the exercise of an option or right attached to a convertible security issued before the offer`

@export Under section 215(1D), are the shares relevant treasury shares?
GIVEN `the shares were held by the transferor company as treasury shares on the date of the offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the shares held by the transferor company as treasury shares on the date of the offer?
      `the shares became treasury shares after the date of the offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the shares become shares held by the transferor company as treasury shares after the date of the offer?
      `the shares became treasury shares before the date the offer's terms specify` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did they become so held before a date specified in, or worked out under, the terms of the offer?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(1D), are the shares relevant treasury shares` IS
    `s 215(1D) the shares are relevant treasury shares` `the shares were held by the transferor company as treasury shares on the date of the offer` `the shares became treasury shares after the date of the offer` `the shares became treasury shares before the date the offer's terms specify`

@export Under section 215(1C)(b), are the shares to be disregarded because they have ceased to be held as treasury shares?
GIVEN `the shares are relevant treasury shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares relevant treasury shares (treasury shares within section 215(1D))?
      `the shares have ceased to be held as treasury shares after the date of the offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have the shares ceased to be held as treasury shares after the date of the offer?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(1C)(b), are the shares to be disregarded because they have ceased to be held as treasury shares` IS
    `s 215(1C)(b) the shares are to be disregarded` `the shares are relevant treasury shares` `the shares have ceased to be held as treasury shares after the date of the offer`

@export Under section 215(1E), does a later issue of shares on the exercise of an option affect the approval, the transferee's right to give notice or the notice's validity?
GIVEN `the requisite percentage of the shares for the approval of the offer has been reached` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the requisite percentage (90%) of the total number of shares for the approval of the offer been reached?
      `a later issue of shares is on the exercise of an option or right within subsection (1C)(a)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the later issue of shares on the exercise of an option or right attached to a convertible security issued on or before the date of the offer?
      `the matter in question` IS A `s 215(1E) matter` @desc What is in question: the approval, the transferee's right to give a notice after the approval, the validity of such a notice, or some other matter?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(1E), does a later issue of shares on the exercise of an option affect the approval, the transferee's right to give notice or the notice's validity` IS
    `s 215(1E) the subsequent issue of shares affects the matter` `the requisite percentage of the shares for the approval of the offer has been reached` `a later issue of shares is on the exercise of an option or right within subsection (1C)(a)` `the matter in question`

§§ `Section 215(2): the statement of the other dissenting shareholders`

-- s 215(2). A dissenting shareholder given notice may, by written demand served within one month of the notice, require the transferor company to supply a statement of the other dissenting shareholders.
@export Under section 215(2), am I entitled to require the transferor company to supply the statement of the other dissenting shareholders?
GIVEN `the transferee has given the notice under subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the transferee given the notice under section 215(1)?
      `the day the transferee gave the notice under subsection (1)` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the transferee give the notice that it desires to acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares?
      `the day I served the written demand on the transferor company` IS A DATE @desc On what day did you serve the written demand on the transferor company?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(2), am I entitled to require the transferor company to supply the statement of the other dissenting shareholders` IS
    `s 215(2) the dissenting shareholder is entitled to require the transferor company to supply the statement` `the transferee has given the notice under subsection (1)` `the day the transferee gave the notice under subsection (1)` `the day I served the written demand on the transferor company`

-- s 215(2). The transferee is not entitled or bound to acquire the shares until 14 days after the statement is posted. The layer-1 rule is the bar, and so is the question.
@export Under section 215(2), is the transferee not yet entitled or bound to acquire my shares because the statement has not been posted to me 14 days ago?
GIVEN `the transferee has given the notice under subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the transferee given the notice under section 215(1)?
      `I served a written demand on the transferor company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you serve a written demand on the transferor company for the statement?
      `the statement was posted to me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the transferor company posted the statement to you?
      `the day the statement was posted to me` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the statement posted to you? (any date if it was not)
      `the day asked about` IS A DATE @desc On what day do you ask whether the transferee is yet entitled and bound to acquire your shares?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(2), is the transferee not yet entitled or bound to acquire my shares because the statement has not been posted to me 14 days ago` IS
    `s 215(2) the transferee is not yet entitled or bound to acquire the shares` `the transferee has given the notice under subsection (1)` `I served a written demand on the transferor company` `the day the statement was posted to me, if it was` `the day asked about`
    WHERE
        `the day the statement was posted to me, if it was` MEANS IF `the statement was posted to me` THEN JUST `the day the statement was posted to me` ELSE NOTHING

§§ `Section 215(3) and (3A): the 90% reached by the transfers; the holder's right to require acquisition`

@export Under section 215(3), do the shares transferred, together with the other shares the transferee holds, comprise or include 90%?
GIVEN `the total number of the shares in the transferor company, or of the class, treasury shares included` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares does the transferor company have in issue (or of the class concerned), treasury shares included?
      `the number of shares transferred to the transferee or its nominee under the scheme or contract` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares have been transferred to the transferee or its nominee under the scheme or contract?
      `the number of other shares in the transferor company the transferee held at the date of the transfer` IS A NUMBER @desc How many other shares in the transferor company did the transferee hold at the date of the transfer?
      `the number of shares held by the transferor company as treasury shares` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares does the transferor company hold as treasury shares?
      `the 90% is measured against a class of the shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the 90% measured against a class of the shares, and not against the total number of the shares?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(3), do the shares transferred, together with the other shares the transferee holds, comprise or include 90%` IS
    `s 215(3) the shares transferred, together with the other shares held by the transferee, comprise or include 90%` `the share count` `the 90% is measured against a class of the shares`
    WHERE
         `the share count` MEANS `s 215(3) share count` WITH
             `s 215(3) the total number of the shares in the transferor company, or of the class, treasury shares included` IS `the total number of the shares in the transferor company, or of the class, treasury shares included`
             `s 215(3) the number of shares transferred to the transferee or its nominee pursuant to the scheme or contract` IS `the number of shares transferred to the transferee or its nominee under the scheme or contract`
             `s 215(3) the number of other shares in the transferor company held by the transferee at the date of the transfer` IS `the number of other shares in the transferor company the transferee held at the date of the transfer`
             `s 215(3A) the number of shares held by the transferor company as treasury shares` IS `the number of shares held by the transferor company as treasury shares`

@export Under section 215(3A), how many treasury shares are treated as acquired by the transferee?
GIVEN `the total number of the shares in the transferor company, or of the class, treasury shares included` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares does the transferor company have in issue (or of the class concerned), treasury shares included?
      `the number of shares transferred to the transferee or its nominee under the scheme or contract` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares have been transferred to the transferee or its nominee under the scheme or contract?
      `the number of other shares in the transferor company the transferee held at the date of the transfer` IS A NUMBER @desc How many other shares in the transferor company did the transferee hold at the date of the transfer?
      `the number of shares held by the transferor company as treasury shares` IS A NUMBER @desc How many shares does the transferor company hold as treasury shares?
      `the 90% is measured against a class of the shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the 90% measured against a class of the shares, and not against the total number of the shares?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 215(3A), how many treasury shares are treated as acquired by the transferee` IS
    `s 215(3A) the number of the treasury shares treated as having been acquired by the transferee` `the share count` `the 90% is measured against a class of the shares`
    WHERE
         `the share count` MEANS `s 215(3) share count` WITH
             `s 215(3) the total number of the shares in the transferor company, or of the class, treasury shares included` IS `the total number of the shares in the transferor company, or of the class, treasury shares included`
             `s 215(3) the number of shares transferred to the transferee or its nominee pursuant to the scheme or contract` IS `the number of shares transferred to the transferee or its nominee under the scheme or contract`
             `s 215(3) the number of other shares in the transferor company held by the transferee at the date of the transfer` IS `the number of other shares in the transferor company the transferee held at the date of the transfer`
             `s 215(3A) the number of shares held by the transferor company as treasury shares` IS `the number of shares held by the transferor company as treasury shares`

-- s 215(3)(a). Where the 90% is reached, the transferee must, within one month of the transfer, give notice of that fact to the holders of the remaining shares who have not assented.
@export Under section 215(3)(a), must the transferee give notice of the 90% to the holders of the remaining shares who have not assented?
GIVEN `the shares transferred and the transferee's other shares comprise or include 90%` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the shares transferred, together with the other shares the transferee holds, comprise or include 90% of the total number of the shares (or of the class)?
      `the transferee has already given notice of the 90% on an earlier transfer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the transferee already given the notice of the 90% on a previous transfer under the scheme or contract?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(3)(a), must the transferee give notice of the 90% to the holders of the remaining shares who have not assented` IS
    `s 215(3)(a) the transferee must give notice of that fact to the holders of the remaining shares who have not assented` `the shares transferred and the transferee's other shares comprise or include 90%` `the transferee has already given notice of the 90% on an earlier transfer`

@export Under section 215(3)(a), was the notice of the 90% given within one month from the date of the transfer?
GIVEN `the day of the transfer` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the transfer made?
      `the day the transferee gave notice of the 90%` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the transferee give notice of the 90% to the holders of the remaining shares?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(3)(a), was the notice of the 90% given within one month from the date of the transfer` IS
    `s 215(3)(a) the notice was given within one month from the date of the transfer` `the day of the transfer` `the day the transferee gave notice of the 90%`

-- s 215(3)(b). Within 3 months of that notice, a holder who has not assented may require the transferee to acquire the holder's shares.
@export Under section 215(3)(b), may I require the transferee to acquire my shares?
GIVEN `the shares transferred and the transferee's other shares comprise or include 90%` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the shares transferred, together with the other shares the transferee holds, comprise or include 90% of the total number of the shares (or of the class)?
      `I am a holder of the remaining shares who has not assented` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a holder of the remaining shares who has not assented to the scheme or contract?
      `I was given notice of the 90%` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you given notice of the 90% by the transferee?
      `the day I was given notice of the 90%` IS A DATE @desc On what day were you given that notice? (any date if you were not)
      `the day I required the transferee to acquire my shares` IS A DATE @desc On what day did you require the transferee to acquire your shares?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(3)(b), may I require the transferee to acquire my shares` IS
    `s 215(3)(b) the holder may require the transferee to acquire the shares in question` `the shares transferred and the transferee's other shares comprise or include 90%` `I am a holder of the remaining shares who has not assented` `the day I was given notice of the 90%, if I was` `the day I required the transferee to acquire my shares`
    WHERE
        `the day I was given notice of the 90%, if I was` MEANS IF `I was given notice of the 90%` THEN JUST `the day I was given notice of the 90%` ELSE NOTHING

@export Under section 215(3), is the transferee entitled and bound to acquire my shares?
GIVEN `I have given notice requiring the transferee to acquire my shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you given notice requiring the transferee to acquire your shares?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(3), is the transferee entitled and bound to acquire my shares` IS
    `s 215(3) the transferee is entitled and bound to acquire the shares` `I have given notice requiring the transferee to acquire my shares`

@export Under section 215(3), on what terms must the transferee acquire my shares?
GIVEN `other terms have been agreed between the transferee and me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you and the transferee agreed other terms?
      `the Court has ordered other terms on an application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Court, on the application of the transferee or of you, ordered other terms?
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 215(3) terms`
DECIDE `Under section 215(3), on what terms must the transferee acquire my shares` IS
    `s 215(3) the terms on which the transferee must acquire the shares` `other terms have been agreed between the transferee and me` `the Court has ordered other terms on an application`

§§ `Section 215(4) to (7): the transfer, the trust, the Official Receiver`

-- s 215(4). The transferee must, after the later of one month from the notice and 14 days from the statement (or the Court's disposal of a pending application), transmit a copy of the notice and pay, allot or transfer the consideration.
@export Under section 215(4), must the transferee transmit a copy of the notice and pay, allot or transfer the consideration to the transferor company?
GIVEN `the transferee has given the notice under subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the transferee given the notice under section 215(1)?
      `the Court has ordered to the contrary on my application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Court, on an application made by the dissenting shareholder, ordered to the contrary?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(4), must the transferee transmit a copy of the notice and pay, allot or transfer the consideration to the transferor company` IS
    `s 215(4) the transferee must transmit a copy of the notice and pay, allot or transfer the consideration to the transferor company` `the transferee has given the notice under subsection (1)` `the Court has ordered to the contrary on my application`

@export Under section 215(4), on what day must the transferee first act?
GIVEN `the day the transferee gave the notice under subsection (1)` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the transferee give the notice that it desires to acquire the dissenting shareholder's shares?
      `I was supplied with the statement under subsection (2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you supplied with the written statement of the names and addresses of the other dissenting shareholders?
      `the day the statement was supplied to me` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the statement supplied to you? (any date if it was not)
      `an application by the dissenting shareholder to the Court is pending` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is an application to the Court by the dissenting shareholder then pending?
      `the application was disposed of` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has that application been disposed of?
      `the day the application was disposed of` IS A DATE @desc On what day was it disposed of? (any date if it has not been)
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `Under section 215(4), on what day must the transferee first act` IS
    `s 215(4) the first day on which the transferee must act` `the day the transferee gave the notice under subsection (1)` `the day the statement was supplied to me, if there was one` `an application by the dissenting shareholder to the Court is pending` `the day the application was disposed of, if it was`
    WHERE
        `the day the statement was supplied to me, if there was one` MEANS IF `I was supplied with the statement under subsection (2)` THEN JUST `the day the statement was supplied to me` ELSE NOTHING
        `the day the application was disposed of, if it was` MEANS IF `the application was disposed of` THEN JUST `the day the application was disposed of` ELSE NOTHING

-- s 215(5). Sums the transferor company receives under section 215 must be paid into a separate bank account and held in trust for the persons entitled.
@export Under section 215(5), has the transferor company paid the sums it received into a separate bank account?
GIVEN `the transferor company received sums under section 215` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the transferor company receive sums under section 215?
      `the sums were paid into a separate bank account` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the sums paid into a separate bank account?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(5), has the transferor company paid the sums it received into a separate bank account` IS
    `s 215(5) the transferor company has paid the sums into a separate bank account` `the transferor company received sums under section 215` `the sums were paid into a separate bank account`

-- s 215(6). A company holding money or other consideration in trust under section 215 may, after 2 years, and must before 10 years from receipt, transfer it to the Official Receiver.
@export Under section 215(6), was what is held in trust transferred to the Official Receiver within the time the subsection allows?
GIVEN `money or other consideration is held in trust under section 215` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is money or other consideration held in trust by a company for a person under section 215?
      `the day the money or other consideration was received by the company holding it` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the money or other consideration received by the company holding it?
      `the day of the transfer to the Official Receiver` IS A DATE @desc On what day was it (or will it be) transferred to the Official Receiver?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(6), was what is held in trust transferred to the Official Receiver within the time the subsection allows` IS
    `s 215(6) the transfer to the Official Receiver is within the time the subsection allows` `money or other consideration is held in trust under section 215` `the day the money or other consideration was received by the company holding it` `the day of the transfer to the Official Receiver`

@export Under section 215(7), how is what has been transferred to the Official Receiver dealt with?
GIVEN `what was received under section 215(6) is money` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is what was received under section 215(6) money?
      `what was received under section 215(6) is other consideration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is what was received under section 215(6) other consideration (not money)?
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 215(7) treatment`
DECIDE `Under section 215(7), how is what has been transferred to the Official Receiver dealt with` IS
    `s 215(7) how the Official Receiver must deal with what is received under subsection (6)` `what was received under section 215(6) is money` `what was received under section 215(6) is other consideration`

§§ `Section 215(8) to (12): the words defined and who is treated as holding or acquiring`

@export Under section 215(8), am I a dissenting shareholder?
GIVEN `I have not assented to the scheme or contract` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you not assented to the scheme or contract?
      `I have failed or refused to transfer my shares under the scheme or contract` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you failed or refused to transfer your shares to the transferee in accordance with the scheme or contract?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(8), am I a dissenting shareholder` IS
    `s 215(8) the shareholder is a dissenting shareholder` `I have not assented to the scheme or contract` `I have failed or refused to transfer my shares under the scheme or contract`

@export Under section 215(8A), am I within the reference to a shareholder in subsection (8)?
GIVEN `my shares were issued on the exercise of an option after the offer was approved` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were your shares issued on the exercise of an option or right within section 215(1C)(a), after the offer was approved under section 215(1)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(8A), am I within the reference to a shareholder in subsection (8)` IS
    `s 215(8A) the shareholder is within the reference to a shareholder in subsection (8)` `my shares were issued on the exercise of an option after the offer was approved`

@export Under section 215(8AA), is the thing within the word "shares"?
GIVEN `the thing is a right or interest in a share` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the thing a right or interest, legal or equitable, in a share, by whatever name called?
      `the thing is an option to acquire a right or interest in a share` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the thing an option to acquire such a right or interest in a share?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(8AA), is the thing within the word "shares"` IS
    `s 215(8AA) the thing is within the word shares` `the thing is a right or interest in a share` `the thing is an option to acquire a right or interest in a share`

@export Under section 215(8AB), am I within the word "shareholders"?
GIVEN `I hold units of shares only beneficially` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you hold the units of shares only beneficially (not as the registered holder)?
      `I am a holder of units of shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a holder of units of shares?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(8AB), am I within the word "shareholders"` IS
    `s 215(8AB) the person is within the word shareholders` `I hold units of shares only beneficially` `I am a holder of units of shares`

@export Under section 215(8AC), are the records within the "register of members"?
GIVEN `the records name and address holders of units of shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the records kept of the names and addresses of holders of units of shares?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(8AC), are the records within the "register of members"` IS
    `s 215(8AC) the records are within the register of members` `the records name and address holders of units of shares`

@export Under section 215(8B), does the definition of shares require the securities to be treated that way?
GIVEN `the securities treatment in question` IS A `s 215(8B) the treatment` @desc How would the securities be treated: as shares of the same class as those into which they convert (or for which the holder may subscribe), as shares of the same class as other securities for that reason alone, or some other way?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(8B), does the definition of shares require the securities to be treated that way` IS
    `s 215(8B) the definition of shares requires the securities to be treated that way` `the securities treatment in question`

@export Under section 215(9), are the shares to be treated as held or acquired by the transferee?
GIVEN `who holds or acquires the shares` IS A `s 215(9) who holds or acquires the shares` @desc Who holds or acquires the shares: a nominee on behalf of the transferee, a related corporation of the transferee, a nominee of a related corporation, or someone else?
      `the corporation is deemed to be related to the transferee by section 6` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the corporation deemed to be related to the transferee by virtue of section 6?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(9), are the shares to be treated as held or acquired by the transferee` IS
    `s 215(9) the shares are to be treated as held or acquired by the transferee` `who holds or acquires the shares` `the corporation is deemed to be related to the transferee by section 6`

@export Under section 215(9A), are the shares also to be treated as held or acquired by the transferee?
GIVEN `the offer was made on or after the commencement of section 10(a) of the 2023 Act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the offer made on or after the date of commencement of section 10(a) of the Companies, Business Trusts and Other Bodies (Miscellaneous Amendments) Act 2023?
      `who else holds or acquires the shares` IS A `s 215(9A) who holds or acquires the shares` @desc Who holds or acquires the shares: a person accustomed to act on the transferee's wishes, the transferee's relative, a person whose wishes the transferee is accustomed to follow, a body corporate they control, or someone else?
      `the voting power held or controlled, as a percentage` IS A NUMBER @desc What percentage of the voting power in the body corporate is the transferee (or the person) entitled to exercise or control?
      `a lower percentage of voting power has been prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a percentage of voting power been prescribed?
      `the percentage of voting power prescribed` IS A NUMBER @desc What percentage has been prescribed? (0 if none)
      `the body corporate acts on the directions of the transferee or the person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the body corporate (or a majority of its directors) accustomed, or under an obligation, formal or informal, to act on the directions, instructions or wishes of the transferee or the person?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(9A), are the shares also to be treated as held or acquired by the transferee` IS
    `s 215(9A) the shares are also to be treated as held or acquired by the transferee` `the offer was made on or after the commencement of section 10(a) of the 2023 Act` `who else holds or acquires the shares` `the control facts`
    WHERE
         `the control facts` MEANS `s 215(12) control facts` WITH
             `s 215(12)(a) the percentage of the voting power in the body corporate the transferee or person is entitled to exercise or control the exercise of` IS `the voting power held or controlled, as a percentage`
             `s 215(12)(a) the percentage of the voting power prescribed, if any` IS (IF `a lower percentage of voting power has been prescribed` THEN JUST `the percentage of voting power prescribed` ELSE NOTHING)
             `s 215(12)(b) the body corporate is, or a majority of its directors are, accustomed or under an obligation whether formal or informal to act in accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of the transferee or the person` IS `the body corporate acts on the directions of the transferee or the person`

@export Under section 215(10), are the shares shares already held by the transferee at the date of the offer?
GIVEN `the transferee holds the shares at the date of the offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the transferee hold the shares at the date of the offer?
      `the transferee has contracted to acquire the shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the transferee contracted to acquire the shares?
      `the shares are the subject of a contract binding the holder to accept the offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares the subject of a contract binding the holder to accept the offer when it is made?
      `that contract was for no consideration and under seal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was that contract entered into for no consideration and under seal?
      `that contract was for no consideration other than a promise to make the offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was that contract entered into for no consideration other than a promise by the transferee to make the offer?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(10), are the shares shares already held by the transferee at the date of the offer` IS
    `s 215(10) the shares are shares already held by the transferee within subsection (1)` `the transferee holds the shares at the date of the offer` `the transferee has contracted to acquire the shares` `the shares are the subject of a contract binding the holder to accept the offer` `that contract was for no consideration and under seal` `that contract was for no consideration other than a promise to make the offer`

@export Under section 215(11), is the transferee to be treated as having acquired the shares by virtue of the approval of the offer?
GIVEN `the transferee acquired shares during the approval period other than by approving the offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc During the period within which an offer can be approved, did the transferee acquire, or contract to acquire, shares whose transfer is involved, otherwise than by virtue of the approval of the offer?
      `the consideration for that acquisition` IS A NUMBER @desc What was the consideration for that acquisition (the amount, in dollars, for the shares)?
      `the consideration specified in the offer at that time` IS A NUMBER @desc What consideration did the terms of the offer specify at that time (the amount for the same shares)?
      `the terms of the offer are later revised` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the terms of the offer later revised?
      `the consideration specified in the revised terms` IS A NUMBER @desc What consideration do the revised terms specify when the revision is announced?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(11), is the transferee to be treated as having acquired the shares by virtue of the approval of the offer` IS
    `s 215(11) the transferee is to be treated as having acquired the shares by virtue of the approval of the offer` `the transferee acquired shares during the approval period other than by approving the offer` `the consideration for that acquisition` `the consideration specified in the offer at that time` `the terms of the offer are later revised` `the consideration specified in the revised terms`

@export Under section 215(12), is the body corporate controlled by the transferee or the person?
GIVEN `the voting power held or controlled, as a percentage` IS A NUMBER @desc What percentage of the voting power in the body corporate is the transferee (or the person) entitled to exercise or control?
      `a lower percentage of voting power has been prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a percentage of voting power been prescribed?
      `the percentage of voting power prescribed` IS A NUMBER @desc What percentage has been prescribed? (0 if none)
      `the body corporate acts on the directions of the transferee or the person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the body corporate (or a majority of its directors) accustomed, or under an obligation, formal or informal, to act on the directions, instructions or wishes of the transferee or the person?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215(12), is the body corporate controlled by the transferee or the person` IS
    `s 215(12) the body corporate is controlled by the transferee or the person` `the control facts`
    WHERE
         `the control facts` MEANS `s 215(12) control facts` WITH
             `s 215(12)(a) the percentage of the voting power in the body corporate the transferee or person is entitled to exercise or control the exercise of` IS `the voting power held or controlled, as a percentage`
             `s 215(12)(a) the percentage of the voting power prescribed, if any` IS (IF `a lower percentage of voting power has been prescribed` THEN JUST `the percentage of voting power prescribed` ELSE NOTHING)
             `s 215(12)(b) the body corporate is, or a majority of its directors are, accustomed or under an obligation whether formal or informal to act in accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of the transferee or the person` IS `the body corporate acts on the directions of the transferee or the person`

§§ `Section 215AA: joint offerors`

@export Under section 215AA(1), is section 215 to be read subject to section 215AA for this offer?
GIVEN `the offer is for all of the shares in a company or all of a class` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the scheme involve an offer to acquire all of the shares in a company, or all of the shares in a particular class?
      `the number of persons making the offer jointly` IS A NUMBER @desc How many persons make the offer jointly?
