@export Under section 215AA(3), are the conditions for the exercise of the rights conferred by section 215(3) satisfied?
GIVEN `the way the shares were acquired` IS A `s 215AA the way the shares were acquired` @desc How were the necessary shares acquired: by virtue of acceptances of the offer, or in other cases?
      `the joint transferees acquired the necessary shares jointly` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the joint transferees acquire, or unconditionally contract to acquire, the necessary shares jointly?
