    `s 215AA(3) the conditions for the exercise of the rights conferred by section 215(3) are satisfied` `the way the shares were acquired` `the joint transferees acquired the necessary shares jointly` `the joint transferees acquired or contracted conditionally to acquire the necessary shares`

@export Under section 215AA(4), how do the joint transferees hold what section 215 gives the transferee?
GIVEN `what the transferee has under section 215` IS A `s 215AA(4) what the transferee has under section 215` @desc What does the transferee have under section 215: a right, or an obligation?
GIVETH A `s 215AA(4) how the joint transferees hold it`
