    `s 215AA(4) how the joint transferees hold what section 215 gives the transferee` `what the transferee has under section 215`

@export Under section 215AA(5), is the notice or document complied with when given by or to any of the joint transferees?
GIVEN `the notice is one that must be made by all of the joint transferees` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the notice one that section 215AA(6) requires to be made by all of the joint transferees?
      `the notice or document is given by or to any of the joint transferees` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the notice or document given or sent by or to any one of the joint transferees?
