@export Under section 215AA(6), is the notice made as the subsection requires?
GIVEN `the notice is made by all of the joint transferees` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the notice made by all of the joint transferees?
      `every joint transferee that is a company had the notice signed by a director` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has every joint transferee that is a company had the notice signed by a director of that company?
