§§ `Section 215AB: offers not communicated to every holder`

@export Under section 215AB(1), does the non-communication of the offer to some holders leave it an offer made under a scheme or contract?
GIVEN `there are shareholders to whom the offer is not communicated` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are there holders of shares to whom the offer to acquire shares in the company is not communicated?
      `those shareholders have no address in Singapore registered with the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do those shareholders have no address in Singapore registered with the company?
      `the offer was not communicated so as not to contravene foreign law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the offer not communicated in order not to contravene the law of a country or territory outside Singapore?
      `the offer was not communicated because it would be unduly onerous` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the offer not communicated because communicating it to those shareholders would in the circumstances be unduly onerous?
      `the offer is published in the Gazette` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer published in the Gazette?
      `the offer can be inspected or obtained and a Gazette notice gives the address` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Can the offer be inspected, or a copy obtained, at a place in Singapore or on a website, with a notice published in the Gazette specifying its address?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215AB(1), does the non-communication of the offer to some holders leave it an offer made under a scheme or contract` IS
    `s 215AB(1) the non-communication of the offer does not prevent it from being an offer made under a scheme or contract` `there are shareholders to whom the offer is not communicated` `those shareholders have no address in Singapore registered with the company` `the offer was not communicated so as not to contravene foreign law` `the offer was not communicated because it would be unduly onerous` `the offer is published in the Gazette` `the offer can be inspected or obtained and a Gazette notice gives the address`

@export Under section 215AB(2), does the impossibility or difficulty of accepting the offer leave it an offer made under a scheme or contract?
GIVEN `an offer is made to acquire shares in a company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is an offer made to acquire shares in a company?
      `it is impossible or more difficult under foreign law for some persons to accept` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it impossible, or more difficult, by reason of the law of a country or territory outside Singapore, for some persons to accept the offer?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215AB(2), does the impossibility or difficulty of accepting the offer leave it an offer made under a scheme or contract` IS
    `s 215AB(2) the impossibility or difficulty of accepting the offer does not prevent it from being made under a scheme or contract` `an offer is made to acquire shares in a company` `it is impossible or more difficult under foreign law for some persons to accept`

@export Under section 215AB(3)(a), is it to be inferred that the offer cannot be an offer made under a scheme or contract unless the requirements of subsection (1) are met?
GIVEN `the offer is not communicated to every holder of shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer not communicated to every holder of shares in the company?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215AB(3)(a), is it to be inferred that the offer cannot be an offer made under a scheme or contract unless the requirements of subsection (1) are met` IS
    `s 215AB(3)(a) it is to be inferred that the offer cannot be an offer made under a scheme or contract unless the requirements of subsection (1)(a), (b) and (c) are met` `the offer is not communicated to every holder of shares`

@export Under section 215AB(3)(b), is it to be inferred that the offer cannot be an offer made under a scheme or contract unless the reason is the one in subsection (2)?
GIVEN `the offer is impossible or more difficult for certain persons to accept` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer impossible, or more difficult, for certain persons to accept?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215AB(3)(b), is it to be inferred that the offer cannot be an offer made under a scheme or contract unless the reason is the one in subsection (2)` IS
    `s 215AB(3)(b) it is to be inferred that the offer cannot be an offer made under a scheme or contract unless the reason is the reason mentioned in subsection (2)` `the offer is impossible or more difficult for certain persons to accept`

