-- s 215C(4). The board must send members, at least 21 days before the general meeting, the proposal, the declarations, a statement of the directors' material interests and the further information a reasonable member needs.
@export Under section 215C(4), did the board send what the subsection requires to every member at least 21 days before the general meeting?
