    `s 215C(4) the board sent what the subsection requires to every member at least 21 days before the general meeting` `the day of the general meeting` `the day the board sent the documents to every member` `the board sent a copy of the amalgamation proposal` `the board sent a copy of the directors' declarations` `the board sent a statement of the directors' material interests` `the board sent such further information as a reasonable member needs`

-- s 215C(5). At least 21 days before the general meeting the directors must send the proposal to every secured creditor and cause a notice to be published in a daily English newspaper.
