    `s 215C(5)(a) the directors sent the amalgamation proposal to every secured creditor at least 21 days before the general meeting` `the day of the general meeting` `the day the directors sent the proposal to the secured creditors` `the directors sent it to every secured creditor`

@export Under section 215C(5)(b), did the directors cause the notice to be published as the paragraph requires at least 21 days before the general meeting?
GIVEN `the day of the general meeting` IS A DATE @desc On what day is (or was) the general meeting?
      `the day the notice was published` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the notice published?
      `the notice was published in a daily English newspaper in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the notice published in at least one daily English newspaper circulating generally in Singapore?
      `the notice says copies may be inspected` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the notice say that copies of the amalgamation proposal are available for inspection by any member or creditor at the registered offices and at any other place it names, during ordinary business hours?
