    `s 215C(6) the director is guilty of the offence` `I contravene the declaration requirement of section 215C(3)`

§§ `Section 215D: short-form amalgamation`

@export Under section 215D(1)(a), are the terms of paragraph (a) in the resolution?
GIVEN `which company continues` IS A `s 215D(1) which company continues` @desc Which company continues: the amalgamated holding company or the amalgamated subsidiary company?
      `the shares of each amalgamating subsidiary company will be cancelled for nothing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the shares of each amalgamating subsidiary company be cancelled without any payment or any other consideration?
      `the holding company's shareholders are issued the same shares in the subsidiary for nothing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shareholders of the amalgamating holding company to be issued, and hold, the same number of shares in the amalgamated subsidiary company as they hold in the holding company, without payment or other consideration?
      `the shares of each amalgamating company other than those issued will be cancelled for nothing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the shares of each amalgamating company, except those issued to the holding company's shareholders, be cancelled without any payment or other consideration?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215D(1)(a), are the terms of paragraph (a) in the resolution` IS
    `s 215D(1)(a) the terms of paragraph (a) are in the resolution` `which company continues` `the shares of each amalgamating subsidiary company will be cancelled for nothing` `the holding company's shareholders are issued the same shares in the subsidiary for nothing` `the shares of each amalgamating company other than those issued will be cancelled for nothing`

@export Under section 215D(1), may a holding company and its wholly-owned subsidiaries amalgamate without complying with sections 215B and 215C?
GIVEN `the amalgamating companies are a company and its wholly-owned subsidiaries` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the amalgamating companies a company and one or more of its wholly-owned subsidiaries?
      `the members of each amalgamating company resolved by special resolution at a general meeting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the members of each amalgamating company, by special resolution at a general meeting, resolve to approve the amalgamation?
      `which company continues` IS A `s 215D(1) which company continues` @desc Which company continues: the amalgamated holding company or the amalgamated subsidiary company?
      `the shares of each amalgamating subsidiary company will be cancelled for nothing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the shares of each amalgamating subsidiary company be cancelled without any payment or any other consideration?
      `the holding company's shareholders are issued the same shares in the subsidiary for nothing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shareholders of the amalgamating holding company to be issued, and hold, the same number of shares in the amalgamated subsidiary company as they hold in the holding company, without payment or other consideration?
      `the shares of each amalgamating company other than those issued will be cancelled for nothing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the shares of each amalgamating company, except those issued to the holding company's shareholders, be cancelled without any payment or other consideration?
      `the constitution of the amalgamated company will be the same as that of the company whose shares are not cancelled` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the constitution of the amalgamated company be the same as the constitution of the amalgamating company whose shares are not cancelled?
      `the directors are satisfied the amalgamated company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the directors of the holding company and of every amalgamating subsidiary company satisfied that the amalgamated company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due at the date the amalgamation is to become effective?
      `the persons named as directors in the resolutions will be the directors of the amalgamated company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the person or persons named as director or directors in the resolution of each amalgamating company be the directors of the amalgamated company?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215D(1), may a holding company and its wholly-owned subsidiaries amalgamate without complying with sections 215B and 215C` IS
    `s 215D(1) the amalgamating holding company and its wholly-owned subsidiaries may amalgamate without complying with sections 215B and 215C` `the amalgamating companies are a company and its wholly-owned subsidiaries` `the members of each amalgamating company resolved by special resolution at a general meeting` `which company continues` `the shares of each amalgamating subsidiary company will be cancelled for nothing` `the holding company's shareholders are issued the same shares in the subsidiary for nothing` `the shares of each amalgamating company other than those issued will be cancelled for nothing` `the constitution of the amalgamated company will be the same as that of the company whose shares are not cancelled` `the directors are satisfied the amalgamated company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due` `the persons named as directors in the resolutions will be the directors of the amalgamated company`

@export Under section 215D(2), may wholly-owned subsidiary companies of the same corporation amalgamate without complying with sections 215B and 215C?
GIVEN `the amalgamating companies are wholly-owned subsidiaries of the same corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the amalgamating companies two or more wholly-owned subsidiary companies of the same corporation?
      `the members of each amalgamating company resolved by special resolution at a general meeting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the members of each amalgamating company, by special resolution at a general meeting, resolve to approve the amalgamation?
      `the shares of all but one of the amalgamating companies will be cancelled for nothing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the shares of all but one of the amalgamating companies be cancelled without payment or other consideration?
      `the constitution of the amalgamated company will be the same as that of the company whose shares are not cancelled` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the constitution of the amalgamated company be the same as the constitution of the amalgamating company whose shares are not cancelled?
      `the directors are satisfied the amalgamated company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the directors of the holding company and of every amalgamating subsidiary company satisfied that the amalgamated company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due at the date the amalgamation is to become effective?
      `the persons named as directors in the resolutions will be the directors of the amalgamated company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the person or persons named as director or directors in the resolution of each amalgamating company be the directors of the amalgamated company?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215D(2), may wholly-owned subsidiary companies of the same corporation amalgamate without complying with sections 215B and 215C` IS
    `s 215D(2) the wholly-owned subsidiary companies of the same corporation may amalgamate without complying with sections 215B and 215C` `the amalgamating companies are wholly-owned subsidiaries of the same corporation` `the members of each amalgamating company resolved by special resolution at a general meeting` `the shares of all but one of the amalgamating companies will be cancelled for nothing` `the constitution of the amalgamated company will be the same as that of the company whose shares are not cancelled` `the directors are satisfied the amalgamated company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due` `the persons named as directors in the resolutions will be the directors of the amalgamated company`

