      `the person has applied to the Court` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the person applied to the Court?
      `the day of the application` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the application made?
      `the date the amalgamation becomes effective` IS A DATE @desc On what date does the amalgamation become effective?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215H(1), may the Court make an order in relation to the amalgamation proposal` IS
    `s 215H(1) the Court may make an order in relation to the amalgamation proposal` `the Court is satisfied giving effect would unfairly prejudice the person` `the person who may apply to the Court` `the person has applied to the Court` `the day of the application` `the date the amalgamation becomes effective`

@export Under section 215H(1), is the order within the Court's power?
GIVEN `the order the Court is asked to make` IS A `s 215H(1) the order` @desc What order is asked for: that effect must not be given to the proposal, that the proposal be modified, that the amalgamating company or its board reconsider it, any other order about the proposal, or an order not about the proposal?
      `the Court thinks fit to make the order` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the Court think fit to make the order?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215H(1), is the order within the Court's power` IS
    `s 215H(1) the order is within the Court's power` `the order the Court is asked to make` `the Court thinks fit to make the order`

@export Under section 215H(2), may the order be made on the terms or conditions?
GIVEN `the Court thinks fit to impose the terms or conditions` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the Court think fit to impose the terms or conditions?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215H(2), may the order be made on the terms or conditions` IS
    `s 215H(2) the order may be made on the terms or conditions` `the Court thinks fit to impose the terms or conditions`

