    WHERE
         `the statement` MEANS `s 215I statement` WITH
             `s 215I(1) it is a statement by the board of directors of the amalgamating company` IS `the statement is by the board of directors of the amalgamating company`
             `s 215I(1)(a) it says the board has formed the opinion that, as regards the amalgamating company's situation at the date of the statement, there is no ground on which the amalgamating company could then be found to be unable to pay its debts` IS `the statement says the board has formed the opinion that the amalgamating company could not then be found unable to pay its debts`
             `s 215I(1)(b) it says the board has formed the opinion that, at the date of the statement, the value of the amalgamating company's assets is not less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)` IS `the statement says the board has formed the opinion that the amalgamating company's assets are not less than its liabilities`
             `s 215I(2) it is in the form of a written declaration` IS `the statement is a written declaration`
