    `s 364(1) the company must complete and have ready for delivery appropriate certificates in respect of the person` `I was registered as a holder of existing shares as at the date of registration` `I was registered as a holder of existing debentures as at the date of registration`

-- s 364(1): layer-1 rule called: `s 364(1) the last day for completing and having ready for delivery the certificates`
