GIVEN `the date of registration of the company` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the company registered? (day, month, year)
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `Under section 364(1), what is the last day for the company to complete and have ready the certificates` IS
    `s 364(1) the last day for completing and having ready for delivery the certificates` `the date of registration of the company`

-- s 364(1): layer-1 rule called: `s 364(1) the company has completed and has ready for delivery the certificates within 60 days after the date of registration`
