            `s 368(1)(h)(i) it has lodged the notice in the prescribed form giving the identification number or registration number on the corporate entity register (if applicable), or other similar evidence of identity acceptable to the Registrar` IS `the foreign company has lodged the notice in the prescribed form giving the identification number or registration number on the corporate entity register (if applicable), or other similar evidence of identity acceptable to the Registrar`
