@export Under section 17(3) and (4), is the formation of the body barred?
GIVEN `the number of persons the body consists of` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the number of persons the body consists of?
      `the body is formed for the purpose of carrying on a business that has for its object the acquisition of gain by the body or by its individual members` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the body is formed for the purpose of carrying on a business that has for its object the acquisition of gain by the body or by its individual members?
      `the body is a company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the body is a company?
      `the body is registered as a company under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the body is registered as a company under this Act?
      `the body is formed pursuant to some other written law in Singapore or letters patent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the body is formed pursuant to some other written law in Singapore or letters patent?
      `the body is an association or a partnership formed solely or mainly for the purpose of carrying on a profession or calling which under a written law may be exercised only by persons who possess the qualifications laid down in that law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the body is an association or a partnership formed solely or mainly for the purpose of carrying on a profession or calling which under a written law may be exercised only by persons who possess the qualifications laid down in that law?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 17(3) and (4), is the formation of the body barred` IS
    `s 17(3) and (4) the formation of the body is barred` `the number of persons the body consists of` `the body is formed for the purpose of carrying on a business that has for its object the acquisition of gain by the body or by its individual members` `the body is a company` `the body is registered as a company under this Act` `the body is formed pursuant to some other written law in Singapore or letters patent` `the body is an association or a partnership formed solely or mainly for the purpose of carrying on a profession or calling which under a written law may be exercised only by persons who possess the qualifications laid down in that law`

