      `the alteration in any way increases the member's liability as at that date to contribute to the share capital of or otherwise to pay money to the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the alteration in any way increases the member's liability as at that date to contribute to the share capital of or otherwise to pay money to the company?
      `the member agrees in writing, before or after the alteration is made, to be bound by it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the member agrees in writing, before or after the alteration is made, to be bound by it?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 39(3), am I as a member bound by the alteration` IS
    `s 39(3) the member is bound by the alteration` `the alteration was made after the date on which the member became a member` `the alteration requires the member to take or subscribe for more shares than the number held by the member at the date on which the alteration is made` `the alteration in any way increases the member's liability as at that date to contribute to the share capital of or otherwise to pay money to the company` `the member agrees in writing, before or after the alteration is made, to be bound by it`

@export Under section 40(1), what sum must I pay for a copy of the constitution?
