      `the day the company issues the copy of the constitution` IS A DATE @desc What is the date for this: the day the company issues the copy of the constitution?
      `the copy is in accordance with the alteration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the copy in accordance with the alteration?
      `a copy of the order or resolution making the alteration is annexed to the copy and the particular clauses affected are indicated` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that a copy of the order or resolution making the alteration is annexed to the copy and the particular clauses affected are indicated?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 40(2), is my company barred from issuing this copy of the constitution` IS
    `s 40(2) the company must not issue the copy of the constitution` `an alteration is made in the constitution of the company` `the day the alteration is made` `the day the company issues the copy of the constitution` `the copy is in accordance with the alteration` `a copy of the order or resolution making the alteration is annexed to the copy and the particular clauses affected are indicated`

