§ `Contracts, deeds and seals; companies with a charitable purpose (ss 41 to 42A)`

@export Under section 41(1), may my company ratify this contract or transaction made before its formation?
GIVEN `the contract or transaction purports to be entered into by the company prior to its formation or by a person on behalf of the company prior to its formation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the contract or transaction purports to be entered into by the company prior to its formation or by a person on behalf of the company prior to its formation?
      `the company has been formed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company been formed?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 41(1), may my company ratify this contract or transaction made before its formation` IS
    `s 41(1) the contract or transaction may be ratified by the company` `the contract or transaction purports to be entered into by the company prior to its formation or by a person on behalf of the company prior to its formation` `the company has been formed`

@export Under section 41(1), is my company bound by and entitled to the benefit of this contract or transaction made before its formation?
GIVEN `the contract or transaction purports to be entered into by the company prior to its formation or by a person on behalf of the company prior to its formation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the contract or transaction purports to be entered into by the company prior to its formation or by a person on behalf of the company prior to its formation?
      `the company has ratified it after its formation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company ratified it after its formation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 41(1), is my company bound by and entitled to the benefit of this contract or transaction made before its formation` IS
    `s 41(1) the company is bound by and entitled to the benefit of the contract or transaction` `the contract or transaction purports to be entered into by the company prior to its formation or by a person on behalf of the company prior to its formation` `the company has ratified it after its formation`

@export Under section 41(2), am I personally bound by the contract or transaction and entitled to its benefit?
GIVEN `the person purported to act in the name or on behalf of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the person purported to act in the name or on behalf of the company?
      `the company has ratified the contract or transaction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company ratified the contract or transaction?
      `there is express agreement to the contrary` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that there is express agreement to the contrary?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 41(2), am I personally bound by the contract or transaction and entitled to its benefit` IS
    `s 41(2) the person is personally bound by the contract or transaction and entitled to the benefit of it` `the person purported to act in the name or on behalf of the company` `the company has ratified the contract or transaction` `there is express agreement to the contrary`

