-- s 125(1). Layer 1 rule called: `s 125(1) the company must issue a duplicate certificate or document to the owner`
@export Under section 125(1), must the company issue me a duplicate certificate or document?
GIVEN `my certificate or other document of title to shares or debentures is lost or destroyed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that your certificate or other document of title to shares or debentures is lost or destroyed?
      `I have applied for a duplicate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you have applied for a duplicate?
      `my application is accompanied by a statutory declaration that the certificate or document has been lost or destroyed and has not been pledged, sold or otherwise disposed of` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that your application is accompanied by a statutory declaration that the certificate or document has been lost or destroyed and has not been pledged, sold or otherwise disposed of?
      `my application is accompanied by an undertaking in writing that if the certificate or document is found or received by me it will be returned to the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that your application is accompanied by an undertaking in writing that if the certificate or document is found or received by you it will be returned to the company?
      `the fee the company requires, in dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the fee the company requires, in dollars?
