      `my document evidences title in relation to listed securities which have been deposited with the Depository and registered in its name or its nominee's name` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that your document evidences title in relation to listed securities which have been deposited with the Depository and registered in its name or its nominee's name?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
