    WHERE
        applies MEANS `s 125(5) subsection (2) applies to the document` `my document evidences title in relation to listed securities which have been deposited with the Depository and registered in its name or its nominee's name`

§ `Part 4, Division 7: private companies (ss 126 to 129)`

-- s 126(1). Layer 1 rule called: `s 126(1) the private company is barred from lodging the transfer of shares`
