      `a proper instrument of transfer has been delivered to the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that a proper instrument of transfer has been delivered to the company?
      `the right to the shares has been transmitted to me by operation of law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the right to the shares has been transmitted to you by operation of law?
