      `the date of the transfer` IS A DATE @desc What is the date of the transfer?
      `the electronic register of members of the company has been updated by the Registrar under section 196A(5)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the electronic register of members of the company has been updated by the Registrar under section 196A(5)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 126(3), is my transfer of shares in the private company one that cannot yet take effect` IS
    `s 126(3) the transfer cannot yet take effect` `the company is a private company` `the date of the transfer` `the electronic register of members of the company has been updated by the Registrar under section 196A(5)`

-- s 128(1). Layer 1 rule called: `s 128(1) the private company must act on the transferor's request`
