      `I have made my request in writing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you have made your request in writing?
      `section 129 allows the company to refuse` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that section 129 allows the company to refuse?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 128(1), must the private company act on my request, as transferor, to lodge the notice of transfer or enter the transferee's name` IS
    `s 128(1) the private company must act on the transferor's request` `the company is a private company` `I have made my request in writing` `section 129 allows the company to refuse`

-- s 128(4). Layer 1 rule called: `s 128(4) the transferor may apply to a judge for a summons`
@export Under section 128(4), may I apply to a judge for a summons?
GIVEN `a person has refused or neglected to comply with a notice given under subsection (3)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that a person has refused or neglected to comply with a notice given under subsection (3)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 128(4), may I apply to a judge for a summons` IS
    `s 128(4) the transferor may apply to a judge for a summons` `a person has refused or neglected to comply with a notice given under subsection (3)`

-- s 129(1). Layer 1 rule called: `s 129(1) the last day for sending notice of the refusal`
@export Under section 129(1), what is the last day for the private company to send notice of its refusal to lodge a notice of transfer?
GIVEN `the date on which the transfer was lodged with the company` IS A DATE @desc What is the date on which the transfer was lodged with the company?
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `Under section 129(1), what is the last day for the private company to send notice of its refusal to lodge a notice of transfer` IS
    `s 129(1) the last day for sending notice of the refusal` `the date on which the transfer was lodged with the company`

-- s 129(1). Layer 1 rule called: `s 129(1) the notice of the refusal was sent within 30 days`
@export Under section 129(1), did the private company send notice of its refusal within 30 days after the transfer was lodged?
GIVEN `the date on which the transfer was lodged with the company` IS A DATE @desc What is the date on which the transfer was lodged with the company?
      `the date on which the notice of the refusal was sent` IS A DATE @desc What is the date on which the notice of the refusal was sent?
