      `the day the statement was lodged` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the statement lodged?
      `the document was executed or made in a place out of Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the document executed or made in a place out of Singapore?
      `the number of further days the Registrar has allowed` IS A NUMBER @desc How many further days has the Registrar allowed for lodging (0 if none)?
      `the Court has by order under section 137 extended the time for registration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Court, by an order under section 137, extended the time for registration?
      `the last day to which the Court has extended the time for registration` IS A DATE @desc To what date has the Court extended the time for registration (any date if it has not)?
