GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 131(2), does subsection (1) affect the contract or obligation for repayment of the money secured by the charge` IS
    `s 131(2) subsection (1) affects the contract or obligation` `the contract or obligation is one for repayment of the money secured by the charge`

-- s 131(2): layer-1 function `s 131(2) the money secured by the charge becomes immediately payable by force of this subsection`.
