§§ `Sections 139 to 141: time, earlier charges and foreign companies`

-- s 139: layer-1 function `s 139 the number of days added to the time specified`.
@export Under section 139, how many days are added to the time specified?
GIVEN `the document was executed or made in a place out of Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the document executed or made in a place out of Singapore?
      `the number of further days the Registrar has allowed` IS A NUMBER @desc How many further days has the Registrar allowed for lodging (0 if none)?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 139, how many days are added to the time specified` IS
    `s 139 the number of days added to the time specified` `the document was executed or made in a place out of Singapore` `the number of further days the Registrar has allowed`

-- s 139: layer-1 function `s 139 the last day for lodging the document`.
@export Under section 139, what is the last day for lodging the document?
GIVEN `the day of the event` IS A DATE @desc On what date did the event happen from which the time runs?
      `the number of days this Division specifies` IS A NUMBER @desc How many days does Division 8 give you?
      `the document was executed or made in a place out of Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the document executed or made in a place out of Singapore?
      `the number of further days the Registrar has allowed` IS A NUMBER @desc How many further days has the Registrar allowed for lodging (0 if none)?
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `Under section 139, what is the last day for lodging the document` IS
    `s 139 the last day for lodging the document` `the day of the event` `the number of days this Division specifies` `the document was executed or made in a place out of Singapore` `the number of further days the Registrar has allowed`

-- s 140: layer-1 function `s 140 this Division applies to the charge`.
@export Under section 140, does Division 8 apply to the charge?
GIVEN `on 29 December 1967 the charge was registrable under one of the repealed written laws` IS A BOOLEAN @desc On 29 December 1967, could the charge be registered under one of the repealed written laws?
      `on 29 December 1967 the charge was not registered under any of those laws` IS A BOOLEAN @desc On 29 December 1967, was the charge not registered under any of those laws?
      `this Division expressly provides otherwise for the charge` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Division 8 expressly provide otherwise for the charge?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 140, does Division 8 apply to the charge` IS
    `s 140 this Division applies to the charge` `on 29 December 1967 the charge was registrable under one of the repealed written laws` `on 29 December 1967 the charge was not registered under any of those laws` `this Division expressly provides otherwise for the charge`

-- s 141: layer-1 function `s 141 a reference in Division 8 to a company includes the foreign company`.
@export Under section 141, does a reference in Division 8 to a company include the foreign company?
GIVEN `the foreign company is registered under Division 2 of Part 11` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the foreign company registered under Division 2 of Part 11?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 141, does a reference in Division 8 to a company include the foreign company` IS
    `s 141 a reference in Division 8 to a company includes the foreign company` `the foreign company is registered under Division 2 of Part 11`

-- s 141: layer-1 function `s 141 this Division applies to the charge of the foreign company`.
@export Under section 141, does Division 8 apply to the charge of the foreign company?
GIVEN `the foreign company is registered under Division 2 of Part 11` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the foreign company registered under Division 2 of Part 11?
      `the charge is on property outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the charge on property outside Singapore?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 141, does Division 8 apply to the charge of the foreign company` IS
    `s 141 this Division applies to the charge of the foreign company` `the foreign company is registered under Division 2 of Part 11` `the charge is on property outside Singapore`

§ `Part 9: investigations`

§§ `Sections 228 to 231: the limit of Part 9, its words, and declaring a company`

-- s 228: layer-1 function `s 228 Part 9 is barred from authorising the investigation`.
@export Under section 228, is Part 9 barred from authorising the investigation?
GIVEN `the investigation is into the insurance business of a company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the investigation into the insurance business of a company?
      `the investigation is into the business of a banking corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the investigation into the business of a banking corporation?
      `Part 9 specifically provides for the investigation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Part 9 specifically provide for the investigation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 228, is Part 9 barred from authorising the investigation` IS
    `s 228 Part 9 is barred from authorising the investigation` `the investigation is into the insurance business of a company` `the investigation is into the business of a banking corporation` `Part 9 specifically provides for the investigation`

-- s 229: layer-1 function `s 229 "officer or agent" the person is an officer or agent of the corporation`.
@export Under section 229, am I an officer or agent of the corporation?
GIVEN `the person is a director, banker, solicitor or auditor of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a director, banker, solicitor or auditor of the corporation?
      `the person has at any time been a director, banker, solicitor or auditor of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you at any time been a director, banker, solicitor or auditor of the corporation?
      `the person has at any time been otherwise employed or appointed by the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you at any time been otherwise employed or appointed by the corporation?
      `the person has in the person's possession any property of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have any property of the corporation in your possession?
      `the person is indebted to the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you indebted to the corporation?
      `the person is capable of giving information concerning the promotion, formation, trading, dealings, affairs or property of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you capable of giving information concerning the promotion, formation, trading, dealings, affairs or property of the corporation?
      `there are reasonable grounds for suspecting or believing that the person is a person mentioned in paragraph (c)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are there reasonable grounds for suspecting or believing that you are a person described in the three questions just before this one?
