      `the person has refused or failed to answer a question lawfully put to the person by such a person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you refused or failed to answer a question such a person lawfully put to you?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 239(2), am I liable to be dealt with in the manner provided in section 236(5)` IS
    `s 239(2) the officer or agent is liable to be dealt with in the manner provided in section 236(5)` `the person is an officer or agent of a corporation` `the person has refused or failed to produce a book or document to a person who produces a written authority of an inspector given under subsection (1)` `the person has refused or failed to answer a question lawfully put to the person by such a person`

§§ `Sections 240 to 242: suspension of proceedings, winding up and penalties`

-- s 240(1): layer-1 function `s 240(1) the action or proceeding is barred without the consent of the Minister`.
@export Under section 240(1), is the action or proceeding barred without the consent of the Minister?
GIVEN `the corporation is a declared company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the corporation a declared company?
      `the kind of action or proceeding` IS A `s 240(1) kind of action or proceeding` @desc Is it an action by the company upon or in respect of a contract, bill of exchange or promissory note; an action by the holder or another person in respect of a bill of exchange or promissory note dealt with by or to the company; or an action of any other kind?
      `the day of the action or proceeding` IS A DATE @desc On what date is the action or proceeding commenced or proceeded with?
      `the date the inspector was appointed in respect of the declared company` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the inspector appointed in respect of the declared company?
      `the inspector has presented the final report to the Minister` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the inspector presented the final report to the Minister?
      `the date the inspector presented the final report to the Minister` IS A DATE @desc On what date did the inspector present the final report (any date if not yet presented)?
      `the Minister has consented to the action or proceeding, generally or in the particular case` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Minister consented to the action or proceeding, generally or in the particular case?
      `the action or proceeding is within the conditions and limitations of the Minister's consent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the action or proceeding within the conditions and limitations of the Minister's consent?
      `the holder or other person gave adequate pecuniary consideration at the time of the negotiation, transfer, issue, endorsement or delivery to the holder or other person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the holder or other person give adequate pecuniary consideration at the time of the negotiation, transfer, issue, endorsement or delivery to the holder or other person?
      `the day of the negotiation, transfer, issue, endorsement or delivery to the holder or other person` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the instrument negotiated, transferred, issued, endorsed or delivered to the holder or other person?
      `the holder or other person was ever a member, officer, agent or employee of the company, or the wife or husband of one, on or before that day` IS A BOOLEAN @desc On or before that date, was the holder or other person ever a member, officer, agent or employee of the company, or the wife or husband of one?
      `the last day, on or before that day, on which the holder or other person was a member, officer, agent or employee of the company, or the wife or husband of one` IS A DATE @desc What was the last day, on or before that date, on which the holder or other person was a member, officer, agent or employee of the company, or the wife or husband of one (any date if never)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 240(1), is the action or proceeding barred without the consent of the Minister` IS
    `s 240(1) the action or proceeding is barred without the consent of the Minister` `the corporation is a declared company` `the kind of action or proceeding` `the day of the action or proceeding` `the date the inspector was appointed in respect of the declared company` `the final report, if any` `the Minister has consented to the action or proceeding, generally or in the particular case` `the action or proceeding is within the conditions and limitations of the Minister's consent` `the holder or other person gave adequate pecuniary consideration at the time of the negotiation, transfer, issue, endorsement or delivery to the holder or other person` `the day of the negotiation, transfer, issue, endorsement or delivery to the holder or other person` `the connection, if any`
    WHERE
        `the final report, if any` MEANS IF `the inspector has presented the final report to the Minister` THEN JUST `the date the inspector presented the final report to the Minister` ELSE NOTHING
        `the connection, if any` MEANS IF `the holder or other person was ever a member, officer, agent or employee of the company, or the wife or husband of one, on or before that day` THEN JUST `the last day, on or before that day, on which the holder or other person was a member, officer, agent or employee of the company, or the wife or husband of one` ELSE NOTHING

-- s 240(2): layer-1 function `s 240(2) the action or proceeding is void and of no effect`.
@export Under section 240(2), is the action or proceeding void and of no effect?
GIVEN `the action or proceeding was commenced or proceeded with in contravention of section 240` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the action or proceeding commenced or proceeded with in contravention of section 240?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 240(2), is the action or proceeding void and of no effect` IS
    `s 240(2) the action or proceeding is void and of no effect` `the action or proceeding was commenced or proceeded with in contravention of section 240`

-- s 241(2): layer-1 function `s 241(2) the foreign company must not carry on business or establish or keep a place of business in Singapore`.
@export Under section 241(2), is the foreign company barred from carrying on business or establishing or keeping a place of business in Singapore?
GIVEN `the body is a foreign company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the body a foreign company?
      `on an application under subsection (1) an order has been made for the affairs of the company so far as assets in Singapore are concerned to be wound up in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN @desc On an application under section 241(1), has an order been made for the company's affairs, so far as assets in Singapore are concerned, to be wound up in Singapore?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 241(2), is the foreign company barred from carrying on business or establishing or keeping a place of business in Singapore` IS
    `s 241(2) the foreign company must not carry on business or establish or keep a place of business in Singapore` `the body is a foreign company` `on an application under subsection (1) an order has been made for the affairs of the company so far as assets in Singapore are concerned to be wound up in Singapore`

-- s 242(1): layer-1 function `s 242(1) the person is guilty of the offence of defeating the purposes of Part 9 or obstructing an investigation`.
@export Under section 242(1), am I guilty of the offence of defeating the purposes of Part 9 or obstructing an investigation?
GIVEN `the person acted with intent to defeat the purposes of Part 9 or to delay or obstruct the carrying out of an investigation under Part 9` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act with intent to defeat the purposes of Part 9 or to delay or obstruct the carrying out of an investigation under Part 9?
      `the person destroys, conceals or alters a book, document or record of or relating to a declared company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you destroy, conceal or alter a book, document or record of or relating to a declared company?
      `the person sends or attempts to send, or conspires with another person to send, out of Singapore a book, document or record of a declared company or property of any description belonging to or in the disposition or under the control of a declared company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you send, attempt to send, or conspire with another person to send, out of Singapore a book, document or record of a declared company, or property belonging to, or in the disposition or under the control of, a declared company?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 242(1), am I guilty of the offence of defeating the purposes of Part 9 or obstructing an investigation` IS
    `s 242(1) the person is guilty of the offence of defeating the purposes of Part 9 or obstructing an investigation` `the person acted with intent to defeat the purposes of Part 9 or to delay or obstruct the carrying out of an investigation under Part 9` `the person destroys, conceals or alters a book, document or record of or relating to a declared company` `the person sends or attempts to send, or conspires with another person to send, out of Singapore a book, document or record of a declared company or property of any description belonging to or in the disposition or under the control of a declared company`

-- s 242(1): layer-1 function `s 242(1) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction`.
@export Under section 242(1), what is the most I can be fined for defeating the purposes of Part 9 or obstructing an investigation, in Singapore dollars?
GIVEN `the person acted with intent to defeat the purposes of Part 9 or to delay or obstruct the carrying out of an investigation under Part 9` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act with intent to defeat the purposes of Part 9 or to delay or obstruct the carrying out of an investigation under Part 9?
      `the person destroys, conceals or alters a book, document or record of or relating to a declared company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you destroy, conceal or alter a book, document or record of or relating to a declared company?
      `the person sends or attempts to send, or conspires with another person to send, out of Singapore a book, document or record of a declared company or property of any description belonging to or in the disposition or under the control of a declared company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you send, attempt to send, or conspire with another person to send, out of Singapore a book, document or record of a declared company, or property belonging to, or in the disposition or under the control of, a declared company?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 242(1), what is the most I can be fined for defeating the purposes of Part 9 or obstructing an investigation, in Singapore dollars` IS
    CONSIDER `s 242(1) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` `the person acted with intent to defeat the purposes of Part 9 or to delay or obstruct the carrying out of an investigation under Part 9` `the person destroys, conceals or alters a book, document or record of or relating to a declared company` `the person sends or attempts to send, or conspires with another person to send, out of Singapore a book, document or record of a declared company or property of any description belonging to or in the disposition or under the control of a declared company`
    WHEN JUST `the sentence` THEN JUST (`the sentence`'s `penalty: the highest fine, in Singapore dollars`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

-- s 242(1): layer-1 function `s 242(1) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction`.
@export Under section 242(1), what is the longest I can be imprisoned for defeating the purposes of Part 9 or obstructing an investigation, in months?
GIVEN `the person acted with intent to defeat the purposes of Part 9 or to delay or obstruct the carrying out of an investigation under Part 9` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act with intent to defeat the purposes of Part 9 or to delay or obstruct the carrying out of an investigation under Part 9?
      `the person destroys, conceals or alters a book, document or record of or relating to a declared company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you destroy, conceal or alter a book, document or record of or relating to a declared company?
      `the person sends or attempts to send, or conspires with another person to send, out of Singapore a book, document or record of a declared company or property of any description belonging to or in the disposition or under the control of a declared company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you send, attempt to send, or conspire with another person to send, out of Singapore a book, document or record of a declared company, or property belonging to, or in the disposition or under the control of, a declared company?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 242(1), what is the longest I can be imprisoned for defeating the purposes of Part 9 or obstructing an investigation, in months` IS
    CONSIDER `s 242(1) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` `the person acted with intent to defeat the purposes of Part 9 or to delay or obstruct the carrying out of an investigation under Part 9` `the person destroys, conceals or alters a book, document or record of or relating to a declared company` `the person sends or attempts to send, or conspires with another person to send, out of Singapore a book, document or record of a declared company or property of any description belonging to or in the disposition or under the control of a declared company`
    WHEN JUST `the sentence` THEN JUST (`the sentence`'s `penalty: the longest imprisonment, in months`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

-- s 242(2): layer-1 function `s 242(2) the person bears the onus of proving that the person did not act with the intent`.
