GIVEN `it is proved in a prosecution for an offence under section 242 that the person charged did an act mentioned in paragraph (a) or (b)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it proved in a prosecution for an offence under section 242 that you did an act mentioned in paragraph (a) or (b)?
