§§ `Sections 243 to 246: ownership of a company, interests in shares, restrictions and foreign inspectors`

-- s 243(3): layer-1 function `s 243(3) the Minister must appoint an inspector to conduct the investigation`.
@export Under section 243(3), must the Minister appoint an inspector to conduct the investigation?
GIVEN `an application for an investigation under section 243 with respect to particular shares or debentures of a corporation is made to the Minister by members of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have members of the corporation applied to the Minister for an investigation under section 243 with respect to particular shares or debentures?
      `the number of applicants or the amount of the shares held by them is not less than that required for an application for the appointment of an inspector under section 232` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the number of applicants, or the amount of the shares they hold, not less than section 232 requires for an application for an inspector?
      `the Minister is satisfied that the application is vexatious` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the Minister satisfied that the application is vexatious?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 243(3), must the Minister appoint an inspector to conduct the investigation` IS
    `s 243(3) the Minister must appoint an inspector to conduct the investigation` `an application for an investigation under section 243 with respect to particular shares or debentures of a corporation is made to the Minister by members of the corporation` `the number of applicants or the amount of the shares held by them is not less than that required for an application for the appointment of an inspector under section 232` `the Minister is satisfied that the application is vexatious`

-- s 243(5)(a): layer-1 function `s 243(5)(a) Part 9 applies in relation to the person as it applies in relation to officers and agents of the corporation`.
@export Under section 243(5)(a), does Part 9 apply in relation to me as it applies in relation to officers and agents of the corporation?
GIVEN `the investigation is an investigation under section 243` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it an investigation under section 243?
      `the person is or has been financially interested in the success or failure, or the apparent success or failure, of the corporation or of another corporation the membership of which is investigated with that of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you, or have you been, financially interested in the success or failure (real or apparent) of the corporation, or of another corporation whose membership is investigated with it?
      `the person is or has been able to control or materially to influence the policy of the corporation or of another corporation the membership of which is investigated with that of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you, or have you been, able to control or materially to influence the policy of the corporation, or of another corporation whose membership is investigated with it?
      `the inspector has reasonable cause to believe that the person is or has been so financially interested or able to control or influence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the inspector have reasonable cause to believe that you are or have been so interested, or able to control or influence?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 243(5)(a), does Part 9 apply in relation to me as it applies in relation to officers and agents of the corporation` IS
    `s 243(5)(a) Part 9 applies in relation to the person as it applies in relation to officers and agents of the corporation` `the investigation is an investigation under section 243` `the person is or has been financially interested in the success or failure, or the apparent success or failure, of the corporation or of another corporation the membership of which is investigated with that of the corporation` `the person is or has been able to control or materially to influence the policy of the corporation or of another corporation the membership of which is investigated with that of the corporation` `the inspector has reasonable cause to believe that the person is or has been so financially interested or able to control or influence`

-- s 244(1): layer-1 function `s 244(1) the Minister may require the person to give the information to the Minister`.
@export Under section 244(1), may the Minister require me to give the information to the Minister?
GIVEN `it appears to the Minister that there is good reason to investigate the ownership of the shares in or debentures of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it appear to the Minister that there is good reason to investigate the ownership of the shares in, or debentures of, the corporation?
      `it appears to the Minister that it is unnecessary to appoint an inspector for the purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it appear to the Minister that it is unnecessary to appoint an inspector for the purpose?
      `the Minister has reasonable cause to believe that the person has or is able to obtain information as to the present and past interests in those shares or debentures and the names and addresses of the persons interested and of any persons who act or have acted on their behalf` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the Minister have reasonable cause to believe that you have, or can obtain, information about the present and past interests in the shares or debentures and the names and addresses of the persons interested and of those who act or have acted for them?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 244(1), may the Minister require me to give the information to the Minister` IS
    `s 244(1) the Minister may require the person to give the information to the Minister` `it appears to the Minister that there is good reason to investigate the ownership of the shares in or debentures of the corporation` `it appears to the Minister that it is unnecessary to appoint an inspector for the purpose` `the Minister has reasonable cause to believe that the person has or is able to obtain information as to the present and past interests in those shares or debentures and the names and addresses of the persons interested and of any persons who act or have acted on their behalf`

-- s 244(3): layer-1 function `s 244(3) the person is guilty of the offence of failing to give information or giving false information`.
@export Under section 244(3), am I guilty of the offence of failing to give information or giving false information?
GIVEN `the person fails to give information required of the person under section 244` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you fail to give information the Minister required of you under section 244?
      `in giving the information the person makes a statement which the person knows to be false in a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In giving the information, did you make a statement you knew to be false in a material particular?
      `in giving the information the person recklessly makes a statement which is false in a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In giving the information, did you recklessly make a statement that was false in a material particular?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 244(3), am I guilty of the offence of failing to give information or giving false information` IS
    `s 244(3) the person is guilty of the offence of failing to give information or giving false information` `the person fails to give information required of the person under section 244` `in giving the information the person makes a statement which the person knows to be false in a material particular` `in giving the information the person recklessly makes a statement which is false in a material particular`

