      `in giving the information the person makes a statement which the person knows to be false in a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In giving the information, did you make a statement you knew to be false in a material particular?
      `in giving the information the person recklessly makes a statement which is false in a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In giving the information, did you recklessly make a statement that was false in a material particular?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 244(3), what is the most I can be fined for failing to give information or giving false information, in Singapore dollars` IS
    CONSIDER `s 244(3) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` `the person fails to give information required of the person under section 244` `in giving the information the person makes a statement which the person knows to be false in a material particular` `in giving the information the person recklessly makes a statement which is false in a material particular`
    WHEN JUST `the sentence` THEN JUST (`the sentence`'s `penalty: the highest fine, in Singapore dollars`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

