-- s 244(4): layer-1 function `s 244(4) section 244 requires the banking corporation to disclose the information to the Minister`.
@export Under section 244(4), does section 244 require the banking corporation to disclose the information to the Minister?
GIVEN `the person is a banking corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person a banking corporation?
      `the information is as to the affairs of a customer of the banking corporation other than the corporation of which the banking corporation is the banker` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the information about the affairs of a customer of the banking corporation other than the corporation of which it is the banker?
      `the Banking Act 1970 provides that the banking corporation must disclose the information to the Minister` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the Banking Act 1970 provide that the banking corporation must disclose the information to the Minister?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 244(4), does section 244 require the banking corporation to disclose the information to the Minister` IS
    `s 244(4) section 244 requires the banking corporation to disclose the information to the Minister` `the person is a banking corporation` `the information is as to the affairs of a customer of the banking corporation other than the corporation of which the banking corporation is the banker` `the Banking Act 1970 provides that the banking corporation must disclose the information to the Minister`

-- s 245(1): layer-1 function `s 245(1) the act is void or barred by the restrictions`.
@export Under section 245(1), is the act void or barred by the restrictions?
GIVEN `the shares are subject to the restrictions by an order of the Minister under subsection (1) that has not been revoked` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares subject to restrictions by an order of the Minister under section 245(1) that has not been revoked?
      `the act` IS A `s 245(1) act concerning the shares` @desc Is the act a transfer of the shares or an exercise of a right to acquire or dispose of them or to be issued with them; an exercise of voting rights; an issue of further shares in right of them; a payment of sums due from the company on them; or any other act?
      `the company is in liquidation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the company in liquidation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 245(1), is the act void or barred by the restrictions` IS
    `s 245(1) the act is void or barred by the restrictions` `the shares are subject to the restrictions by an order of the Minister under subsection (1) that has not been revoked` `the act` `the company is in liquidation`

-- s 245(3): layer-1 function `s 245(3) the person is guilty of the offence of dealing in shares subject to the restrictions`.
