      `the person has knowledge that the shares are subject to the restrictions` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you know that the shares are subject to the restrictions?
      `the person exercises or purports to exercise a right to dispose of the shares or a right to be issued with them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you exercise, or purport to exercise, a right to dispose of the shares or a right to be issued with them?
      `the person votes in respect of the shares, whether as holder or proxy, or appoints a proxy to vote in respect of them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you vote in respect of the shares, as holder or proxy, or appoint a proxy to vote in respect of them?
      `the person is the holder of some of the shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you the holder of some of the shares?
      `the person fails to notify the fact of their being subject to the restrictions to a person whom the person does not know to be aware of that fact but does know to be entitled, apart from the restrictions, to vote in respect of the shares, whether as holder or proxy` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you fail to notify the fact that the shares are subject to the restrictions to a person you do not know to be aware of it but do know to be entitled, apart from the restrictions, to vote in respect of the shares?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 245(3), am I guilty of the offence of dealing in shares subject to the restrictions` IS
    `s 245(3) the person is guilty of the offence of dealing in shares subject to the restrictions` `the shares are for the time being subject to restrictions mentioned in subsection (1)` `the person has knowledge that the shares are subject to the restrictions` `the person exercises or purports to exercise a right to dispose of the shares or a right to be issued with them` `the person votes in respect of the shares, whether as holder or proxy, or appoints a proxy to vote in respect of them` `the person is the holder of some of the shares` `the person fails to notify the fact of their being subject to the restrictions to a person whom the person does not know to be aware of that fact but does know to be entitled, apart from the restrictions, to vote in respect of the shares, whether as holder or proxy`

