    `s 175A(5) the member has exercised the power under subsection (4)` `the member gave notice to the company` `the member transmitted to the company an electronic communication containing the requirement` `the electronic communication was transmitted to the address specified for the purpose by or on behalf of the company`

@export Under section 175A(6), do section 175(1) and (4) apply to the calling of the meeting and the consequences of failure?
GIVEN `a notice has been given under subsection (4) or an electronic communication has been transmitted under subsection (5)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a notice been given under section 175A(4), or an electronic communication transmitted under section 175A(5)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 175A(6), do section 175(1) and (4) apply to the calling of the meeting and the consequences of failure` IS
    `s 175A(6) section 175(1) and (4) apply to the calling of the meeting and the consequences of failure` `a notice has been given under subsection (4) or an electronic communication has been transmitted under subsection (5)`

@export Under section 175A(7), has the resolution ceased to be in force?
GIVEN `the company is converted to a public company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company been converted to a public company?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 175A(7), has the resolution ceased to be in force` IS
    `s 175A(7) the resolution has ceased to be in force` `the company is converted to a public company`

@export Under section 175A(8), is the company excused from holding the annual general meeting after the resolution ceased?
GIVEN `the date the resolution ceased to be in force` IS A DATE @desc On what date did the resolution cease to be in force?
      `the date on which the company is required under section 175 to hold an annual general meeting` IS A DATE @desc On what date is the company required under section 175 to hold an annual general meeting?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 175A(8), is the company excused from holding the annual general meeting after the resolution ceased` IS
    `s 175A(8) the company need not hold the annual general meeting after the resolution ceased` `the date the resolution ceased to be in force` `the date on which the company is required under section 175 to hold an annual general meeting`

@export Under section 175A(9), does subsection (8) relieve the company of the meeting the member required?
GIVEN `the member gave notice under subsection (4) or transmitted an electronic communication under subsection (5)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the member give notice under section 175A(4) or transmit an electronic communication under section 175A(5)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 175A(9), does subsection (8) relieve the company of the meeting the member required` IS
    `s 175A(9) subsection (8) relieves the company of the meeting the member required` `the member gave notice under subsection (4) or transmitted an electronic communication under subsection (5)`

§ `Sections 176 and 177: calling meetings`

@export Under section 176(1A), how many paid-up shares are counted?
GIVEN `the total number of paid-up shares that carry the right of voting at general meetings` IS A NUMBER @desc How many paid-up shares of the company carry the right of voting at general meetings?
      `the number of those shares held as treasury shares` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of those shares does the company hold as treasury shares?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 176(1A), how many paid-up shares are counted` IS
    `s 176(1A) the number of paid-up shares counted` `the total number of paid-up shares that carry the right of voting at general meetings` `the number of those shares held as treasury shares`

@export Under section 176(1), is the requisition by members holding or representing enough?
GIVEN `the company has a share capital` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the company have a share capital?
      `the number of paid-up shares held by the requisitionists at the date of the deposit that carry the right of voting at general meetings` IS A NUMBER @desc How many paid-up shares carrying the right of voting at general meetings did the requisitionists hold at the date of the deposit?
      `the total number of paid-up shares that carry the right of voting at general meetings` IS A NUMBER @desc How many paid-up shares of the company carry the right of voting at general meetings?
      `the number of those shares held as treasury shares` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of those shares does the company hold as treasury shares?
      `the voting rights represented by the requisitionists at the date of the deposit` IS A NUMBER @desc How many voting rights did the requisitionists represent at the date of the deposit?
      `the total voting rights of all the members having at that date a right to vote at general meetings` IS A NUMBER @desc What were the total voting rights of all the members having at that date a right to vote at general meetings?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 176(1), is the requisition by members holding or representing enough` IS
    `s 176(1) the requisition is by members holding or representing enough` `the company has a share capital` `the number of paid-up shares held by the requisitionists at the date of the deposit that carry the right of voting at general meetings` (`s 176(1A) the number of paid-up shares counted` `the total number of paid-up shares that carry the right of voting at general meetings` `the number of those shares held as treasury shares`) `the voting rights represented by the requisitionists at the date of the deposit` `the total voting rights of all the members having at that date a right to vote at general meetings`

@export Under section 176(2), is the requisition in the form the subsection requires?
GIVEN `the requisition states the objects of the meeting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the requisition state the objects of the meeting?
      `the requisition is signed by the requisitionists` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the requisition signed by the requisitionists?
      `the requisition is deposited at the registered office of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the requisition deposited at the registered office of the company?
      `the requisition consists of several documents` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the requisition consist of several documents?
      `the documents are in like form` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the documents in like form?
      `each document is signed by one or more requisitionists` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is each document signed by one or more requisitionists?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 176(2), is the requisition in the form the subsection requires` IS
    `s 176(2) the requisition is in the form the subsection requires` `the requisition states the objects of the meeting` `the requisition is signed by the requisitionists` `the requisition is deposited at the registered office of the company` `the requisition consists of several documents` `the documents are in like form` `each document is signed by one or more requisitionists`

@export Under section 176(1), must the directors proceed to convene an extraordinary general meeting?
GIVEN `the company has a share capital` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the company have a share capital?
      `the number of paid-up shares held by the requisitionists at the date of the deposit that carry the right of voting at general meetings` IS A NUMBER @desc How many paid-up shares carrying the right of voting at general meetings did the requisitionists hold at the date of the deposit?
      `the total number of paid-up shares that carry the right of voting at general meetings` IS A NUMBER @desc How many paid-up shares of the company carry the right of voting at general meetings?
      `the number of those shares held as treasury shares` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of those shares does the company hold as treasury shares?
      `the voting rights represented by the requisitionists at the date of the deposit` IS A NUMBER @desc How many voting rights did the requisitionists represent at the date of the deposit?
      `the total voting rights of all the members having at that date a right to vote at general meetings` IS A NUMBER @desc What were the total voting rights of all the members having at that date a right to vote at general meetings?
      `the requisition states the objects of the meeting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the requisition state the objects of the meeting?
      `the requisition is signed by the requisitionists` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the requisition signed by the requisitionists?
      `the requisition is deposited at the registered office of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the requisition deposited at the registered office of the company?
      `the requisition consists of several documents` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the requisition consist of several documents?
      `the documents are in like form` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the documents in like form?
      `each document is signed by one or more requisitionists` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is each document signed by one or more requisitionists?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 176(1), must the directors proceed to convene an extraordinary general meeting` IS
    `s 176(1) the directors must proceed to convene an extraordinary general meeting` enough form
    WHERE
        enough MEANS `s 176(1) the requisition is by members holding or representing enough` `the company has a share capital` `the number of paid-up shares held by the requisitionists at the date of the deposit that carry the right of voting at general meetings` (`s 176(1A) the number of paid-up shares counted` `the total number of paid-up shares that carry the right of voting at general meetings` `the number of those shares held as treasury shares`) `the voting rights represented by the requisitionists at the date of the deposit` `the total voting rights of all the members having at that date a right to vote at general meetings` EQUALS JUST TRUE
        form MEANS `s 176(2) the requisition is in the form the subsection requires` `the requisition states the objects of the meeting` `the requisition is signed by the requisitionists` `the requisition is deposited at the registered office of the company` `the requisition consists of several documents` `the documents are in like form` `each document is signed by one or more requisitionists` EQUALS JUST TRUE

@export Under section 176(1), have the directors complied with the duty to convene the meeting?
