    `s 178(1)(b) the constitution provision is void insofar as it makes the demand ineffective` `the provision has the effect of making a demand for a poll ineffective` `the question or matter is the election of the chairperson of the meeting or the adjournment of the meeting` `the number of members making the demand who have the right to vote at the meeting` `the voting rights represented by the members making the demand` `the total voting rights of all the members having the right to vote at the meeting` `the sum paid up on the shares the members making the demand hold that confer a right to vote at the meeting` `the total sum paid up on all the shares conferring that right`

