    `s 181(3) the person is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` `I authorise or permit an invitation to appoint as proxy a person or one of a number of persons specified in the invitation` `the invitation is issued at the company's expense` `the invitation is issued to some only of the members entitled to be sent a notice of the meeting and to vote at it by proxy` `subsection (4) gives me a defence`

@export Under section 181(3), what is the most I may be fined, in dollars?
