      `the number of requisitionists who hold shares in the company` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of the requisitionists hold shares in the company?
      `the total sum paid up on the shares the requisitionists hold` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the total sum paid up, in dollars, on the shares the requisitionists hold?
