    `s 194(2) the Court may decide the question on the application` `an application for rectification of the register has been made under section 194(1)` `the question the Court is asked to decide`

-- section 194(3): s 194(3) the Court's order must direct a notice of the rectification to be lodged
@export Under section 194(3), must the Court's order direct a notice of the rectification to be lodged?
GIVEN `the Court is making an order for rectification of the register` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the Court is making an order for rectification of the register?
