      `the day of the application for rectification` IS A DATE @desc What is the day of the application for rectification?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 194(4), is the Court barred from entertaining my application to rectify the register` IS
    `s 194(4) the Court is barred from entertaining the application` `the day on which the entry was made in the register` `the day of the application for rectification`

§§ `Section 195: trusts, executors and administrators`

