GIVEN `default is made in complying with section 196` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that default is made in complying with section 196?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 196(9), what is the most my company, an officer in default or the person in default can be fined` IS
    CONSIDER `s 196(9) the most the public company, an officer in default or the person in default may be sentenced to on conviction` `default is made in complying with section 196`
        WHEN JUST p THEN JUST (p's `penalty: the highest fine, in Singapore dollars`)
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING


§ `Part 5 Division 4A: the electronic register of members kept by the Registrar (sections 196A to 196E)`

§§ `Section 196A: the electronic register`

-- section 196A(1): s 196A(1) the Registrar must keep an electronic register of members of the company
@export Under section 196A(1), must the Registrar keep an electronic register of my private company's members?
GIVEN `the company is a private company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the company a private company, as section 4(1) of the Companies Act uses the word?
      `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date are you asking?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196A(1), must the Registrar keep an electronic register of my private company's members` IS
    `s 196A(1) the Registrar must keep an electronic register of members of the company` `the company is a private company` `the date asked`

-- section 196A(2): s 196A(2) the electronic register contains what the subsection requires
@export Under section 196A(2), does the electronic register contain what the subsection requires?
GIVEN `the register contains the names of the members` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the register contains the names of the members?
      `the register contains the addresses of the members that the paragraph requires` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the register contains the addresses of the members that the paragraph requires?
      `the company has a share capital` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that your company has a share capital?
      `the register contains a statement of the shares held by each member and of the amount paid or agreed to be considered as paid on the shares of each member` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the register contains a statement of the shares held by each member and of the amount paid or agreed to be considered as paid on the shares of each member?
      `the register contains the date of every allotment of shares to members (including any deemed allotment as defined in section 63(3)) and the number of shares comprised in each allotment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the register contains the date of every allotment of shares to members (including any deemed allotment as defined in section 63(3)) and the number of shares comprised in each allotment?
      `the register contains the date on which the name of each person was entered in the register as a member` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the register contains the date on which the name of each person was entered in the register as a member?
      `the register contains the date on which each person who ceased to be a member during the previous 7 years so ceased to be a member` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the register contains the date on which each person who ceased to be a member during the previous 7 years so ceased to be a member?
      `the register shows every change to the information in paragraph (a)(i), (ii) and (iii) that occurs on or after 3 January 2016` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the register shows every change to the information in paragraph (a)(i), (ii) and (iii) that occurs on or after 3 January 2016?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196A(2), does the electronic register contain what the subsection requires` IS
    `s 196A(2) the electronic register contains what the subsection requires` `the electronic register's entries`
    WHERE
        `the electronic register's entries` MEANS `s 196A(2) electronic register entries` WITH
            `the register contains the names of the members` IS `the register contains the names of the members`
            `the register contains the addresses of the members that the paragraph requires` IS `the register contains the addresses of the members that the paragraph requires`
            `the company has a share capital` IS `the company has a share capital`
            `the register contains a statement of the shares held by each member and of the amount paid or agreed to be considered as paid on the shares of each member` IS `the register contains a statement of the shares held by each member and of the amount paid or agreed to be considered as paid on the shares of each member`
            `the register contains the date of every allotment of shares to members (including any deemed allotment as defined in section 63(3)) and the number of shares comprised in each allotment` IS `the register contains the date of every allotment of shares to members (including any deemed allotment as defined in section 63(3)) and the number of shares comprised in each allotment`
            `the register contains the date on which the name of each person was entered in the register as a member` IS `the register contains the date on which the name of each person was entered in the register as a member`
            `the register contains the date on which each person who ceased to be a member during the previous 7 years so ceased to be a member` IS `the register contains the date on which each person who ceased to be a member during the previous 7 years so ceased to be a member`
            `the register shows every change to the information in paragraph (a)(i), (ii) and (iii) that occurs on or after 3 January 2016` IS `the register shows every change to the information in paragraph (a)(i), (ii) and (iii) that occurs on or after 3 January 2016`

-- section 196A(2)(a)(ii): s 196A(2)(a)(ii) the register contains the addresses the paragraph requires of the member
@export Under section 196A(2)(a)(ii), does the register contain the addresses the paragraph requires of this member?
GIVEN `the member is an individual` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the member is an individual?
      `the register contains the residential address of the member` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the register contains the residential address of the member?
      `the register contains the contact address of the member` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the register contains the contact address of the member?
      `the register contains the address of the member` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the register contains the address of the member?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196A(2)(a)(ii), does the register contain the addresses the paragraph requires of this member` IS
    `s 196A(2)(a)(ii) the register contains the addresses the paragraph requires of the member` `the member is an individual` `the register contains the residential address of the member` `the register contains the contact address of the member` `the register contains the address of the member`

-- section 196A(2)(a)(v): s 196A(2)(a)(v) the register must contain the date on which the person ceased to be a member
@export Under section 196A(2)(a)(v), must the register contain the date on which this person ceased to be a member?
GIVEN `the day on which the person ceased to be a member` IS A DATE @desc What is the day on which the person ceased to be a member?
      `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date are you asking?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196A(2)(a)(v), must the register contain the date on which this person ceased to be a member` IS
    `s 196A(2)(a)(v) the register must contain the date on which the person ceased to be a member` `the day on which the person ceased to be a member` `the date asked`

-- section 196A(3): s 196A(3) the electronic register must show stock instead of shares
@export Under section 196A(3), must the electronic register show stock instead of shares?
GIVEN `the private company has converted any of its shares into stock` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that your private company has converted any of its shares into stock?
      `the company notifies the Registrar of the conversion` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that your company notifies the Registrar of the conversion?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196A(3), must the electronic register show stock instead of shares` IS
    `s 196A(3) the electronic register must show stock instead of shares` `the private company has converted any of its shares into stock` `the company notifies the Registrar of the conversion`

-- section 196A(4): s 196A(4) particulars of the change must be given to the Registrar
@export Under section 196A(4), must particulars of the change be given to the Registrar?
GIVEN `the private company purchases one or more of its shares or stocks in circumstances in which section 76H applies` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that your private company purchases one or more of its shares or stocks in circumstances in which section 76H applies?
      `the company cancels all the shares or stocks immediately after the purchase in accordance with section 76K(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that your company cancels all the shares or stocks immediately after the purchase in accordance with section 76K(1)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196A(4), must particulars of the change be given to the Registrar` IS
    `s 196A(4) particulars of the change must be given to the Registrar` `the private company purchases one or more of its shares or stocks in circumstances in which section 76H applies` `the company cancels all the shares or stocks immediately after the purchase in accordance with section 76K(1)`

-- section 196A(5): s 196A(5) the Registrar must update the electronic register of members in accordance with the change
@export Under section 196A(5), must the Registrar update the electronic register of members in accordance with the change?
GIVEN `the change is lodged under section 31(1), 63(1), 70(6), 71(1B), 74A(3), 76B(7), 76K(1A), 126(2) or 128(1)(a)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the change is lodged under section 31(1), 63(1), 70(6), 71(1B), 74A(3), 76B(7), 76K(1A), 126(2) or 128(1)(a)?
      `the change is required or authorised by another provision of this Act to be lodged with the Registrar` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the change is required or authorised by another provision of this Act to be lodged with the Registrar?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196A(5), must the Registrar update the electronic register of members in accordance with the change` IS
    `s 196A(5) the Registrar must update the electronic register of members in accordance with the change` `the change is lodged under section 31(1), 63(1), 70(6), 71(1B), 74A(3), 76B(7), 76K(1A), 126(2) or 128(1)(a)` `the change is required or authorised by another provision of this Act to be lodged with the Registrar`

-- section 196A(6): s 196A(6) the entry is prima facie evidence of the truth of the matter
@export Under section 196A(6), is the entry in the electronic register prima facie evidence of the truth of the matter?
GIVEN `the entry is in the electronic register of members required to be kept by the Registrar under section 196A` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the entry is in the electronic register of members required to be kept by the Registrar under section 196A?
      `the matter is directed or authorised by this Act to be entered or inserted in the register of members` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this Act direct or authorise the matter you are asking about to be entered or inserted in the electronic register of members?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196A(6), is the entry in the electronic register prima facie evidence of the truth of the matter` IS
    `s 196A(6) the entry is prima facie evidence of the truth of the matter` `the entry is in the electronic register of members required to be kept by the Registrar under section 196A` `the matter is directed or authorised by this Act to be entered or inserted in the register of members`

§§ `Section 196B: information from private companies that existed before 3 January 2016`

-- section 196B(1): s 196B(1) the private company must lodge the information with the Registrar
@export Under section 196B(1), must my private company lodge the information with the Registrar?
GIVEN `the private company was incorporated, or converted from a public company, before 3 January 2016` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that your private company was incorporated, or converted from a public company, before 3 January 2016?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196B(1), must my private company lodge the information with the Registrar` IS
    `s 196B(1) the private company must lodge the information with the Registrar` `the private company was incorporated, or converted from a public company, before 3 January 2016`

-- section 196B(1): s 196B(1) the last day for lodging the information
@export Under section 196B(1), by what day must my private company lodge the information?
GIVEN `the date on which the first return under section 197 is required to be lodged with the Registrar after 3 January 2016` IS A DATE @desc What is the date on which the first return under section 197 is required to be lodged with the Registrar after 3 January 2016?
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `Under section 196B(1), by what day must my private company lodge the information` IS
    `s 196B(1) the last day for lodging the information` `the date on which the first return under section 197 is required to be lodged with the Registrar after 3 January 2016`

-- section 196B(1): s 196B(1) the information was lodged by the last day
@export Under section 196B(1), did my private company lodge the information by that day?
GIVEN `the date on which the first return under section 197 is required to be lodged with the Registrar after 3 January 2016` IS A DATE @desc What is the date on which the first return under section 197 is required to be lodged with the Registrar after 3 January 2016?
      `the day on which the information is lodged with the Registrar` IS A DATE @desc What is the day on which the information is lodged with the Registrar?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196B(1), did my private company lodge the information by that day` IF
    `s 196B(1) the information was lodged by the last day` `the date on which the first return under section 197 is required to be lodged with the Registrar after 3 January 2016` `the day on which the information is lodged with the Registrar`

-- section 196B(2): s 196B(2) the Registrar may enter the corresponding information from the old register of members
@export Under section 196B(2), may the Registrar enter the corresponding information from my company's old register of members?
GIVEN `the private company is one to which section 196B(1) applies` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that your private company is one to which section 196B(1) applies?
      `the company fails to lodge any of the information that it is required to lodge under section 196B(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that your company fails to lodge any of the information that it is required to lodge under section 196B(1)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196B(2), may the Registrar enter the corresponding information from my company's old register of members` IS
    `s 196B(2) the Registrar may enter the corresponding information from the old register of members` `the private company is one to which section 196B(1) applies` `the company fails to lodge any of the information that it is required to lodge under section 196B(1)`

-- section 196B(3): s 196B(3) the Registrar may extend the time for furnishing the information
@export Under section 196B(3), may the Registrar extend the time for my company to furnish the information?
GIVEN `the Registrar considers it fair and reasonable to extend the time in the circumstances of the case` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the Registrar considers it fair and reasonable to extend the time in the circumstances of the case?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196B(3), may the Registrar extend the time for my company to furnish the information` IS
    `s 196B(3) the Registrar may extend the time for furnishing the information` `the Registrar considers it fair and reasonable to extend the time in the circumstances of the case`

§§ `Section 196C: sections 194 and 195 apply to the electronic register`

-- section 196C(1): s 196C(1) section 194 applies in respect of the electronic register of members
@export Under section 196C(1), does section 194 apply in respect of the electronic register of members?
GIVEN `the register is the electronic register of members of a private company required to be kept by the Registrar under section 196A` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the register is the electronic register of members of a private company required to be kept by the Registrar under section 196A?
