    `s 196C(1) section 194 applies in respect of the electronic register of members` `the register is the electronic register of members of a private company required to be kept by the Registrar under section 196A`

-- section 196C(2): s 196C(2) section 195 applies in respect of the electronic register of members, with the modifications
@export Under section 196C(2), does section 195 apply in respect of the electronic register of members, with the modifications?
GIVEN `the register is the electronic register of members of a private company required to be kept by the Registrar under section 196A` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the register is the electronic register of members of a private company required to be kept by the Registrar under section 196A?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
