    `s 196C(2) section 195 applies in respect of the electronic register of members, with the modifications` `the register is the electronic register of members of a private company required to be kept by the Registrar under section 196A`

-- section 196C(2)(a): s 196C(2)(a) the reference is read as a reference to the electronic register of the private company
@export Under section 196C(2)(a), is this reference in section 195 read as a reference to the electronic register of the private company?
GIVEN `the reference in section 195 that is being read` IS A `s 196C(2) reference in section 195` @desc Which reference in section 195 are you asking about: a reference to a register under section 194, a reference to a branch register, or some other reference?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196C(2)(a), is this reference in section 195 read as a reference to the electronic register of the private company` IS
    `s 196C(2)(a) the reference is read as a reference to the electronic register of the private company` `the reference in section 195 that is being read`

-- section 196C(2)(b): s 196C(2)(b) the reference is omitted
@export Under section 196C(2)(b), is this reference in section 195 omitted?
GIVEN `the reference in section 195 that is being read` IS A `s 196C(2) reference in section 195` @desc Which reference in section 195 are you asking about: a reference to a register under section 194, a reference to a branch register, or some other reference?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196C(2)(b), is this reference in section 195 omitted` IS
    `s 196C(2)(b) the reference is omitted` `the reference in section 195 that is being read`

-- section 196C(2)(c): s 196C(2)(c) the company must notify the Registrar of the trustee's request
@export Under section 196C(2)(c), must my company notify the Registrar of the trustee's request?
GIVEN `the trustee has made a request under section 195(3) for the relevant shares to be marked in the electronic register of members` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the trustee has made a request under section 195(3) for the relevant shares to be marked in the electronic register of members?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196C(2)(c), must my company notify the Registrar of the trustee's request` IS
    `s 196C(2)(c) the company must notify the Registrar of the trustee's request` `the trustee has made a request under section 195(3) for the relevant shares to be marked in the electronic register of members`

-- section 196C(2)(c): s 196C(2)(c) the last day for notifying the Registrar
@export Under section 196C(2)(c), by what day must my company notify the Registrar of the trustee's request?
GIVEN `the day on which the trustee makes the request` IS A DATE @desc What is the day on which the trustee makes the request?
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `Under section 196C(2)(c), by what day must my company notify the Registrar of the trustee's request` IS
    `s 196C(2)(c) the last day for notifying the Registrar` `the day on which the trustee makes the request`

-- section 196C(2)(c): s 196C(2)(c) the Registrar was notified within 14 days after the request
@export Under section 196C(2)(c), did my company notify the Registrar within 14 days after the trustee's request?
GIVEN `the day on which the trustee makes the request` IS A DATE @desc What is the day on which the trustee makes the request?
      `the day on which the company notifies the Registrar` IS A DATE @desc What is the day on which your company notifies the Registrar?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196C(2)(c), did my company notify the Registrar within 14 days after the trustee's request` IF
    `s 196C(2)(c) the Registrar was notified within 14 days after the request` `the day on which the trustee makes the request` `the day on which the company notifies the Registrar`

§§ `Section 196D: the old register of members`

-- section 196D(1): s 196D(1) the private company must keep its old registers
@export Under section 196D(1), must my private company keep its old registers?
