    `s 196D(1) the private company must keep its old registers` `the private company was incorporated, or converted from a public company, before 3 January 2016`

-- section 196D(1)(a): s 196D(1)(a) the private company must continue to keep the branch register
@export Under section 196D(1)(a), must my private company continue to keep its branch register?
GIVEN `the company kept a branch register of members under section 196 in force immediately before 3 January 2016` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that your company kept a branch register of members under section 196 in force immediately before 3 January 2016?
