GIVEN `the day on which the last member referred to in the register ceased to be a member of the company` IS A DATE @desc What is the day on which the last member referred to in the register ceased to be a member of your company?
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `Under section 196D(1)(b), until what day must my private company keep its register of members after the last member ceased` IS
    `s 196D(1)(b) the last day of the period for keeping the register of members` `the day on which the last member referred to in the register ceased to be a member of the company`

-- section 196D(1)(b): s 196D(1)(b) the private company must continue to keep its register of members
@export Under section 196D(1)(b), must my private company continue to keep its register of members?
GIVEN `the company kept a register of members under section 190(1) in force immediately before 3 January 2016` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that your company kept a register of members under section 190(1) in force immediately before 3 January 2016?
      `every member referred to in the register has ceased to be a member of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that every member referred to in the register has ceased to be a member of your company?
      `the day on which the last member referred to in the register ceased to be a member of the company` IS A DATE @desc What is the day on which the last member referred to in the register ceased to be a member of your company?
      `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date are you asking?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196D(1)(b), must my private company continue to keep its register of members` IS
    `s 196D(1)(b) the private company must continue to keep its register of members` `the company kept a register of members under section 190(1) in force immediately before 3 January 2016` `every member referred to in the register has ceased to be a member of the company` `the day on which the last member referred to in the register ceased to be a member of the company` `the date asked`

-- section 196D(2): s 196D(2) the private company is not required to update the old register for the change
@export Under section 196D(2), is my private company not required to update the old register for this change?
GIVEN `the day of the change in the particulars` IS A DATE @desc What is the day of the change in the particulars?
      `the day on which the company furnishes the information required to be furnished to the Registrar under section 196B(1)` IS A DATE @desc What is the day on which your company furnishes the information required to be furnished to the Registrar under section 196B(1)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196D(2), is my private company not required to update the old register for this change` IS
    `s 196D(2) the private company is not required to update the old register for the change` `the day of the change in the particulars` `the day on which the company furnishes the information required to be furnished to the Registrar under section 196B(1)`

-- section 196D(3)(a): s 196D(3)(a) the old sections continue to apply to the old registers
@export Under section 196D(3)(a), do the old sections continue to apply to the old registers?
GIVEN `the date asked is within the period for which the old register is required to be kept under subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the date asked is within the period for which the old register is required to be kept under subsection (1)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196D(3)(a), do the old sections continue to apply to the old registers` IS
    `s 196D(3)(a) the old sections continue to apply to the old registers` `the date asked is within the period for which the old register is required to be kept under subsection (1)`

-- section 196D(3)(b): s 196D(3)(b) the non-compliance may be dealt with and punished as if the old sections were in force
@export Under section 196D(3)(b), may this non-compliance be dealt with and punished as if the old sections were in force?
GIVEN `the date asked is within the period for which the old register is required to be kept under subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the date asked is within the period for which the old register is required to be kept under subsection (1)?
      `the non-compliance is with a section mentioned in paragraph (a)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the non-compliance is with a section mentioned in paragraph (a)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 196D(3)(b), may this non-compliance be dealt with and punished as if the old sections were in force` IS
    `s 196D(3)(b) the non-compliance may be dealt with and punished as if the old sections were in force` `the date asked is within the period for which the old register is required to be kept under subsection (1)` `the non-compliance is with a section mentioned in paragraph (a)`

