      `the application is made on the company's behalf by a majority of its directors` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the application is made on your company's behalf by a majority of its directors?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 344A(2), is the application made on my company's behalf as the subsection requires` IS
    `s 344A(2) the application is made on the company's behalf as the subsection requires` `the application is made on the company's behalf by all its directors` `the application is made on the company's behalf by a majority of its directors`

