    `s 344A(4) the Registrar is barred from striking the company's name off the register under this section` `the Registrar has published in the Gazette a notice stating that the Registrar intends to exercise the power under section 344A in relation to the company and inviting any person to show cause why that should not be done within the period prescribed` `the day on which that notice was published` `the date asked`

-- section 344A(4): s 344A(4) the last day of the 60 days after the publication of the notice
