-- section 344A(8)(a): s 344A(8)(a) the Registrar must ensure that the particulars of the company and of the application are sent to the Inland Revenue Authority of Singapore and the Central Provident Fund Board
@export Under section 344A(8)(a), must the Registrar ensure that particulars of my company and of the application are sent to the Inland Revenue Authority of Singapore and the Central Provident Fund Board?
