§ `Nominee directors and nominee shareholders (ss 386AKA to 386ALB)`
-- These questions arise only where a director or shareholder is, or may be, a nominee.

-- Layer 1: `s 386AKA(1) the company or foreign company has kept the register of nominee directors as required` (sgn-nominees.l4).
@export Under section 386AKA(1), has the company or foreign company kept the register of nominee directors as required?
GIVEN `the body is a company, or a foreign company registered under Division 2 of Part 11` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the body a company, or a foreign company registered under Division 2 of Part 11?
      `the body has kept a register of its directors who are nominees in the prescribed form and at the prescribed place` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company or foreign company kept a register of its directors who are nominees, in the prescribed form and at the prescribed place?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 386AKA(1), has the company or foreign company kept the register of nominee directors as required` IS
    `s 386AKA(1) the company or foreign company has kept the register of nominee directors as required` `the body is a company, or a foreign company registered under Division 2 of Part 11` `the body has kept a register of its directors who are nominees in the prescribed form and at the prescribed place`

-- Layer 1: `s 386AKA(2) the company or foreign company is barred from disclosing the register of nominee directors to the person` (sgn-nominees.l4).
@export Under section 386AKA(2), is the company or foreign company barred from disclosing the register of nominee directors to the person?
GIVEN `the person is a member of the public` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person a member of the public?
      `the disclosure is made in compliance with a requirement made, or in the exercise of a power conferred, under section 386AM` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the disclosure made in compliance with a requirement made, or in the exercise of a power conferred, under section 386AM?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 386AKA(2), is the company or foreign company barred from disclosing the register of nominee directors to the person` IS
    `s 386AKA(2) the company or foreign company is barred from disclosing the register of nominee directors to the person` `the person is a member of the public` `the disclosure is made in compliance with a requirement made, or in the exercise of a power conferred, under section 386AM`

