      `the shareholder receives dividends, in respect of shares of which the shareholder is the registered holder, on behalf of any other person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the shareholder receive dividends on the shares the shareholder holds on the register on behalf of any other person?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
