    `s 386ALB(7) the shareholder is a nominee` `the shareholder is accustomed or under an obligation, whether formal or informal, to vote, in respect of shares of which the shareholder is the registered holder, in accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of any other person` `the shareholder receives dividends, in respect of shares of which the shareholder is the registered holder, on behalf of any other person`

-- Layer 1: `s 386ALB(1), (1A), (2), (3), (3A) and (4) the last day by which the shareholder must have informed the company or foreign company` (sgn-nominees.l4).
@export Under section 386ALB(1), (1A), (2), (3), (3A) and (4), by what day must the shareholder have informed the company or foreign company that the shareholder is a nominee?
GIVEN `whether the shareholder is a shareholder of a company or of a foreign company registered under Division 2 of Part 11` IS A `s 386ALB kind of body` @desc Is the shareholder a shareholder of a company, or of a foreign company registered under Division 2 of Part 11?
      `the date the company was incorporated or the foreign company was registered` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the company incorporated, or the foreign company registered under Division 2 of Part 11?
      `the appointed day under section 386ALB(8)` IS A DATE @desc On what date did section 10 of the Companies and Limited Liability Partnerships (Miscellaneous Amendments) Act 2024 come into operation?
      `the shareholder was a nominee on the date of incorporation or registration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the shareholder a nominee on the date the company was incorporated or the foreign company registered?
      `the shareholder becomes a nominee after that date` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the shareholder become a nominee after the date of incorporation or registration?
      `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee` IS A DATE @desc On what date did the shareholder become a nominee (leave the date of incorporation or registration if not applicable)?
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `Under section 386ALB(1), (1A), (2), (3), (3A) and (4), by what day must the shareholder have informed the company or foreign company that the shareholder is a nominee` IS
    `s 386ALB(1), (1A), (2), (3), (3A) and (4) the last day by which the shareholder must have informed the company or foreign company` `whether the shareholder is a shareholder of a company or of a foreign company registered under Division 2 of Part 11` `the date the company was incorporated or the foreign company was registered` `the appointed day under section 386ALB(8)` `the shareholder was a nominee on the date of incorporation or registration` `the shareholder becomes a nominee after that date` `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee`

-- Layer 1: `s 386ALB(5) the last day by which the shareholder must have informed the company or foreign company` (sgn-nominees.l4).
