DECIDE `Under section 386ALB(5), by what day must the shareholder have informed the company or foreign company that the shareholder has ceased to be a nominee or that the particulars have changed` IS
    `s 386ALB(5) the last day by which the shareholder must have informed the company or foreign company` `the date the shareholder ceased to be a nominee, or the date the particulars provided changed`

