§ `What the Registrar may require, the central registers, codes and exemption (ss 386AM to 386AP)`
-- These questions arise only where the Registrar or an officer of the Authority has asked for something, or the company is lodging with the Registrar.

-- Layer 1: `s 386AM(1) the Registrar or an officer of the Authority may exercise the power` (sgn-registrar.l4).
@export Under section 386AM(1), may the Registrar or an officer of the Authority exercise the power?
