      `the person is the Registrar or an officer of the Authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person the Registrar or an officer of the Accounting and Corporate Regulatory Authority?
      `the body is a company or foreign company to which this Part applies` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the body a company or foreign company to which Part 11A applies?
      `the inquiry is necessary to ascertain whether the provisions of this Part are complied with` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the inquiry one that is necessary to ascertain whether the provisions of Part 11A are complied with?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 386AM(1), may the Registrar or an officer of the Authority exercise the power` IS
    `s 386AM(1) the Registrar or an officer of the Authority may exercise the power` `which power of section 386AM(1) is in question` `the person is the Registrar or an officer of the Authority` `the body is a company or foreign company to which this Part applies` `the inquiry is necessary to ascertain whether the provisions of this Part are complied with`

-- Layer 1: `s 386AM(4) the person is guilty of the offence` (sgn-registrar.l4).
