DECIDE `Under section 386AM(4), am I guilty of the offence of failing to comply with a requirement` IS
    `s 386AM(4) the person is guilty of the offence` `the person fails to comply with a requirement imposed under subsection (1) or (2)`

-- Layer 1: `s 386AM(4A) the person is guilty of the offence` (sgn-registrar.l4).
@export Under section 386AM(4A), am I guilty of the offence of providing false or misleading information?
GIVEN `the person, in complying with a requirement imposed, or in answering an inquiry made, under subsection (1) or (2), provides to the Registrar or an officer of the Authority information that is false or misleading in a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In complying with a requirement, or answering an inquiry, under section 386AM(1) or (2), did you give the Registrar or an officer of the Authority information that was false or misleading in a material particular?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 386AM(4A), am I guilty of the offence of providing false or misleading information` IS
    `s 386AM(4A) the person is guilty of the offence` `the person, in complying with a requirement imposed, or in answering an inquiry made, under subsection (1) or (2), provides to the Registrar or an officer of the Authority information that is false or misleading in a material particular`

-- Layer 1: `s 386AM(4B) this section gives a defence on these facts` (sgn-registrar.l4).
@export Under section 386AM(4B), does this section give me a defence on these facts?
GIVEN `the proceedings are for an offence under subsection (4A)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the proceedings for an offence under section 386AM(4A) (giving false or misleading information)?
      `the accused has proved, on a balance of probabilities, that the accused took all reasonable steps and exercised all due diligence to ensure that the information provided was not false or misleading` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Can the accused prove, on a balance of probabilities, that the accused took all reasonable steps and exercised all due diligence to ensure that the information provided was not false or misleading?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 386AM(4B), does this section give me a defence on these facts` IS
    `s 386AM(4B) this section gives a defence on these facts` `the proceedings are for an offence under subsection (4A)` `the accused has proved, on a balance of probabilities, that the accused took all reasonable steps and exercised all due diligence to ensure that the information provided was not false or misleading`

-- Layer 1: `s 386AN(3) the company or foreign company has lodged what the Registrar required in time and in the prescribed form and manner` (sgn-registrar.l4).
@export Under section 386AN(3), has the company or foreign company lodged what the Registrar required in time and in the prescribed form and manner?
