    `s 386AN(3) the company or foreign company has lodged what the Registrar required in time and in the prescribed form and manner` `the company or foreign company has lodged the particulars, matters and updates` `the lodgment is in the prescribed form and manner` `the day the company or foreign company lodged them` `the day the Registrar required the company or foreign company to lodge them` `the prescribed time, in days` `the date asked`

