      `the company or foreign company has lodged all updates to that register that occurred after the lodgment of the particulars` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company or foreign company lodged all the updates to its register of nominee directors that occurred after it lodged the particulars?
      `the company or foreign company has lodged all particulars contained in its register of nominee shareholders` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company or foreign company lodged with the Registrar all the particulars in its register of nominee shareholders?
      `the company or foreign company has lodged all updates to that register that occurred after the lodgment of the particulars of nominee shareholders` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company or foreign company lodged all the updates to its register of nominee shareholders that occurred after it lodged the particulars?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 386ANA(2), has the company or foreign company lodged what the subsection requires` IS
    `s 386ANA(2) the company or foreign company has lodged what the subsection requires` `the company or foreign company has lodged all particulars contained in its register of nominee directors` `the company or foreign company has lodged all updates to that register that occurred after the lodgment of the particulars` `the company or foreign company has lodged all particulars contained in its register of nominee shareholders` `the company or foreign company has lodged all updates to that register that occurred after the lodgment of the particulars of nominee shareholders`

