DECIDE `Under section 387A(7), is the number or address the person gave the person's current address for sections 387A and 387B` IS
    `s 387A(7) the number or address is the current address of the person of the company` `the question arises for the purposes of section 387A or section 387B` `the number or address used for electronic communication has been notified by the person in writing to the company as one at which that notice or document may be sent to the person` `the company has no reason to believe that that notice or document sent to the person at that address will not reach the person`

-- s 387B(1) the document may be sent using electronic communications to the current address of the person  [sgo-service.l4]
@export Under section 387B(1), may a document be sent to a person by electronic communications at the person's current address?
