      `the document is required or permitted to be sent under this Act or under the constitution of the company by the company or the directors of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the document one that the Companies Act or the company's constitution requires or permits the company or its directors to send?
      `the person is a member of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person to whom the notice or document goes a member (shareholder) of the company?
