    `s 407(1) the person is guilty of an offence` `the person does that which under this Act the person is forbidden to do` `the person does not do that which under this Act the person is required or directed to do` `the person otherwise contravenes or fails to comply with a provision of this Act`

-- s 407(2) the highest penalty or punishment on conviction  [sgo-penalties.l4]
