GIVEN `the person is guilty of an offence under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you been found guilty of an offence under the Companies Act?
      `the Act expressly mentions a penalty or punishment for the offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the Companies Act expressly mention a penalty or punishment for the offence?
      `the highest fine the Act mentions, in Singapore dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the highest fine the Act mentions, in Singapore dollars? (0 if it mentions none)
      `the longest imprisonment the Act mentions, in months` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the longest imprisonment the Act mentions, in months? (0 if it mentions none)
      `the Act allows both the fine and the imprisonment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the Act allow both the fine and the imprisonment together?
      `the Act also imposes a default penalty` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the Act also impose a default penalty?
GIVETH A MAYBE Penalty
