    `s 407(2) the highest penalty or punishment on conviction` `the person is guilty of an offence under this Act` `the penalty or punishment the Act expressly mentions`
    WHERE
        `the penalty or punishment the Act expressly mentions` MEANS IF `the Act expressly mentions a penalty or punishment for the offence` THEN JUST (Penalty OF `the highest fine the Act mentions, in Singapore dollars`, `the longest imprisonment the Act mentions, in months`, `the Act allows both the fine and the imprisonment`, `the Act also imposes a default penalty`) ELSE NOTHING

